(3735026, 527511, 45475, '<td valign="top">Karen, I LOVE this. The symmetry is fantastic, the b&amp;w conversion is just marvellous, and this is such a clean and crisp vision that it could very well serve to hang in a cafe. Great work from you, can''t wait to add it to my faves. Sure, ok, some folk might get picky, but you essentially have only two subjects here, as far as I''m concerned. Good luck!</td>', 'Karen, I LOVE this. The symmetry is fantastic, the b&w conversion is just marvellous, and this is such a clean and crisp vision that it could very well serve to hang in a cafe. Great work from you, can''t wait to add it to my faves. Sure, ok, some folk might get picky, but you essentially have only two subjects here, as far as I''m concerned. Good luck!', '2007-06-04 01:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
