(3735262, 523005, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm, the figure on the left of the photo - is that a swim suit with sleeves?  Personally I am not comfortable wearing a bikini as most people seem to be, and I''d be interested in something like that.. is there a link to somewhere online that has those? (You can PM me if you''d like).<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself it is full of energy and life! It makes me smile to think of how much fun the girls seem to be having.. the happiness is contagous! In addition, great colors, and nice relating to the challenge by having the swim suits be similar patterns.  Lighting is nice too.. really makes the water sparkle (and makes me thirsty, hehe!).</td>', 'Hm, the figure on the left of the photo - is that a swim suit with sleeves?  Personally I am not comfortable wearing a bikini as most people seem to be, and I''d be interested in something like that.. is there a link to somewhere online that has those? (You can PM me if you''d like). As for the photo itself it is full of energy and life! It makes me smile to think of how much fun the girls seem to be having.. the happiness is contagous! In addition, great colors, and nice relating to the challenge by having the swim suits be similar patterns.  Lighting is nice too.. really makes the water sparkle (and makes me thirsty, hehe!).', '2007-06-04 02:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
