(3735695, 527394, 61654, '<td valign="top">HA!  You must''ve been thrilled to catch this.  Good composition.  I kinda like the fact that there''s some motion blur.  Weird, random and sorta creepy! 8</td>', 'HA!  You must''ve been thrilled to catch this.  Good composition.  I kinda like the fact that there''s some motion blur.  Weird, random and sorta creepy! 8', '2007-06-04 04:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
