(3735704, 526302, 61654, '<td valign="top">Either your flash ruined this one or you delved into the "shadow/highlights" and blew it out too much.  I love me the kitty shots, so for idea and composition, I''ll give you a 5.  PS:  They''re so cute! :)</td>', 'Either your flash ruined this one or you delved into the "shadow/highlights" and blew it out too much.  I love me the kitty shots, so for idea and composition, I''ll give you a 5.  PS:  They''re so cute! :)', '2007-06-04 04:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
