(3735713, 527345, 53964, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait, but without the title I would find no connection with the challenge. Even with the title I still can''t tell there''s two distinct flowers.</td>', 'A lovely portrait, but without the title I would find no connection with the challenge. Even with the title I still can''t tell there''s two distinct flowers.', '2007-06-04 04:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
