(3735751, 526864, 61654, '<td valign="top">I really like this in a sentimental cute sorta way. Had this been taken when the sun wasn''t so bright, like early in the morning or in the evening it might have been better for me.  I know sometimes moments just happen, but you should pose them and re-shoot this without that fence in the background. It would be a "wall-hanger". 5</td>', 'I really like this in a sentimental cute sorta way. Had this been taken when the sun wasn''t so bright, like early in the morning or in the evening it might have been better for me.  I know sometimes moments just happen, but you should pose them and re-shoot this without that fence in the background. It would be a "wall-hanger". 5', '2007-06-04 04:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
