(3736004, 527350, 38032, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this might be a polarizing image - some will think it''s crAzy and weird and others will think it''s Krazy and weerd.  I like it in it''s indescribable oddness and originality.  I just noticed the doll legs in fact - and I''m wondering if the background is part of the crazy train.  A tad more sharpness and pulling the forground from the background might have helped a bit but quite nice as is. 7</td>', 'I''m thinking this might be a polarizing image - some will think it''s crAzy and weird and others will think it''s Krazy and weerd.  I like it in it''s indescribable oddness and originality.  I just noticed the doll legs in fact - and I''m wondering if the background is part of the crazy train.  A tad more sharpness and pulling the forground from the background might have helped a bit but quite nice as is. 7', '2007-06-04 08:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736017, 524811, 21714, '<td valign="top">Now this is interesting. I am wanting to see it rotated but I am not suggesting anything. This is way better than anything I could think of. Excellent.</td>', 'Now this is interesting. I am wanting to see it rotated but I am not suggesting anything. This is way better than anything I could think of. Excellent.', '2007-06-04 08:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
