(3736066, 525533, 51793, '<td valign="top">Is this the same photographer that shot the same bird in the freestudy???<br/> <br/>Birds are amazing in color. I just love the way they look.</td>', 'Is this the same photographer that shot the same bird in the freestudy??? Birds are amazing in color. I just love the way they look.', '2007-06-04 08:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
