(3736103, 527199, 78388, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.<br/> <br/>I think the flash here is a little harsh (particularly off the rightmost gentleman''s shoes). I think it''s a shame that so much detail is lost in the black suits, I''m not sure if this could have been improved in post processing?</td>', 'Nice idea. I think the flash here is a little harsh (particularly off the rightmost gentleman''s shoes). I think it''s a shame that so much detail is lost in the black suits, I''m not sure if this could have been improved in post processing?', '2007-06-04 09:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736106, 526806, 66353, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - and the seagull was at the right spot at the right time :)<br/>Well done...</td>', 'Excellent composition - and the seagull was at the right spot at the right time :)Well done...', '2007-06-04 09:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736107, 527304, 66353, '<td valign="top">Don''t know it it''s the post processing, but this seems to lack focus</td>', 'Don''t know it it''s the post processing, but this seems to lack focus', '2007-06-04 09:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736108, 525645, 79242, '<td valign="top">I have never liked the cell shaded look...... not bad, but it does not appeal to me</td>', 'I have never liked the cell shaded look...... not bad, but it does not appeal to me', '2007-06-04 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736112, 527542, 79242, '<td valign="top">Photo is too noisy. Not a bad subject, but there is room for improvement...Good luck.</td>', 'Photo is too noisy. Not a bad subject, but there is room for improvement...Good luck.', '2007-06-04 09:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736120, 527676, 78388, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, it''s quite un-DPC (a good thing IMO!) not to have notched the saturation up in post processing to the point where the colours were blinding, and similar in terms of unsharp mask. Sadly I think this may lose you a little in overall score - I think you needed to go a little further with both to make the image "pop" at this size.</td>', 'Nice shot, it''s quite un-DPC (a good thing IMO!) not to have notched the saturation up in post processing to the point where the colours were blinding, and similar in terms of unsharp mask. Sadly I think this may lose you a little in overall score - I think you needed to go a little further with both to make the image "pop" at this size.', '2007-06-04 09:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736121, 527657, 79242, '<td valign="top">I think I would like it better if you cropped off the bottom half of the picture....Very good though</td>', 'I think I would like it better if you cropped off the bottom half of the picture....Very good though', '2007-06-04 09:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736124, 526258, 78388, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the topic.</td>', 'Great idea for the topic.', '2007-06-04 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736127, 524935, 78388, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/> <br/>I hope people get the "similar" part of the challenge description as you have, rather than expect two items the same.</td>', 'Very nice. I hope people get the "similar" part of the challenge description as you have, rather than expect two items the same.', '2007-06-04 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736131, 525817, 78388, '<td valign="top">Great lightning!<br/> <br/>I think might have been improved if the bottom had been cropped - the random details on the horizon bring the shot down imo.</td>', 'Great lightning! I think might have been improved if the bottom had been cropped - the random details on the horizon bring the shot down imo.', '2007-06-04 09:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736133, 525715, 78388, '<td valign="top">Cute - but too much flash!</td>', 'Cute - but too much flash!', '2007-06-04 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736134, 527034, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like the the looks of the two flamingos in front, I think if they could have been completly isolated from the others it would have helped but still a nice double take.</td>', 'I like the the looks of the two flamingos in front, I think if they could have been completly isolated from the others it would have helped but still a nice double take.', '2007-06-04 09:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736146, 527291, 78388, '<td valign="top">This looks soft/out of focus, it it a crop?</td>', 'This looks soft/out of focus, it it a crop?', '2007-06-04 09:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736158, 527261, 15711, '<td valign="top">ARTSY ARTSY ARTSY!!!</td>', 'ARTSY ARTSY ARTSY!!!', '2007-06-04 09:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736161, 526806, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and well captured. I love the bird to add a touch of balance to the negative space on the right of the nets. Beautiful sky.</td>', 'Simple and well captured. I love the bird to add a touch of balance to the negative space on the right of the nets. Beautiful sky.', '2007-06-04 09:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736163, 527415, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting.  The sunglasses really make the shot for me.</td>', 'I love the lighting.  The sunglasses really make the shot for me.', '2007-06-04 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736167, 525846, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced.  I''m wondering if it might not have had even further impact if done in black and white. There are so many colours... hmm just thinking out loud.</td>', 'Nicely balanced.  I''m wondering if it might not have had even further impact if done in black and white. There are so many colours... hmm just thinking out loud.', '2007-06-04 09:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736169, 526857, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Simple but something we can all relate to. I like the tilt of the stairs.  Simple and effective! 7</td>', 'I really like this.  Simple but something we can all relate to. I like the tilt of the stairs.  Simple and effective! 7', '2007-06-04 09:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736173, 527417, 60495, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t the be double down...lol</td>', 'Shouldn''t the be double down...lol', '2007-06-04 09:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736176, 527348, 15711, '<td valign="top">The grasses in the foreground almost seem selectively desaturated. It has a surreal sense to it.</td>', 'The grasses in the foreground almost seem selectively desaturated. It has a surreal sense to it.', '2007-06-04 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736179, 527111, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the duplicity. I guess that''s what the challenge calls for, huh?  But this is a bit different which makes it more than just two girls on cell phones.  I like that one is under the rectangular grate and the other isn''t. Makes it less symmetrical. 7</td>', 'I like the duplicity. I guess that''s what the challenge calls for, huh?  But this is a bit different which makes it more than just two girls on cell phones.  I like that one is under the rectangular grate and the other isn''t. Makes it less symmetrical. 7', '2007-06-04 09:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736180, 527226, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Your only pulling low score on this??? What a shame...some people have no imagination. I assume people don''t understand the difference between similar and exactly alike. Bummer.</td>', 'Great shot. Your only pulling low score on this??? What a shame...some people have no imagination. I assume people don''t understand the difference between similar and exactly alike. Bummer.', '2007-06-04 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736182, 525821, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and exposure. What beautiful animals.  They really do look like clones don''t they? They look like they''re smiling. ;~D</td>', 'Nice focus and exposure. What beautiful animals.  They really do look like clones don''t they? They look like they''re smiling. ;~D', '2007-06-04 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736186, 527149, 78388, '<td valign="top">The processing really lifts this image.</td>', 'The processing really lifts this image.', '2007-06-04 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736189, 527488, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the (almost) high key effect. I think since the cap has a distinct pattern, I''d have had her wearing a top that didn''t have the black stripes. They are a touch distracting.  Fun and whimsical though.</td>', 'I like the (almost) high key effect. I think since the cap has a distinct pattern, I''d have had her wearing a top that didn''t have the black stripes. They are a touch distracting.  Fun and whimsical though.', '2007-06-04 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736192, 526584, 50641, '<td valign="top">From the expression on their faces, you''d think someone just poured a gallon of milk on the ground right in front of them.  Very nicely balanced, tonewise.  Great clarity.  Keep these gals in mind for the next Larson challenge ;-)</td>', 'From the expression on their faces, you''d think someone just poured a gallon of milk on the ground right in front of them.  Very nicely balanced, tonewise.  Great clarity.  Keep these gals in mind for the next Larson challenge ;-)', '2007-06-04 09:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3736193, 526971, 15711, '<td valign="top">Some of the newbies who''ve never seen one of these will truly be awed.  The bokeh is stunning. Pretty amazing when you think about it. Ain''t nature grand?</td>', 'Some of the newbies who''ve never seen one of these will truly be awed.  The bokeh is stunning. Pretty amazing when you think about it. Ain''t nature grand?', '2007-06-04 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
