(3737046, 527664, 52285, '<td valign="top">Wow. I haven''t finishet to see all the photos inthe contest (72% for now) but this is so far my favourite. If the upper pebble farther end was a little sharper (not necessarily extra sharp) this would have been super, IMHO.</td>', 'Wow. I haven''t finishet to see all the photos inthe contest (72% for now) but this is so far my favourite. If the upper pebble farther end was a little sharper (not necessarily extra sharp) this would have been super, IMHO.', '2007-06-04 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737053, 527226, 52285, '<td valign="top">Good double portrait. The eyes are a little too overprocessed, for my personal taste, I think it would have worked also with more natural colours.</td>', 'Good double portrait. The eyes are a little too overprocessed, for my personal taste, I think it would have worked also with more natural colours.', '2007-06-04 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737060, 527049, 21714, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy and admire shots when I see in them how other people have imagined or have seen things that I would have most likely missed. My first reaction was - who would have thought of that! Then I sit here staring at it for a while, feeling happy. I am loving photography. <br/> <br/>It takes a great eye and mind to see it and realise what''s there. It takes a great photographer to capture and show us the experience before it becomes the unrecorded past.</td>', 'I always enjoy and admire shots when I see in them how other people have imagined or have seen things that I would have most likely missed. My first reaction was - who would have thought of that! Then I sit here staring at it for a while, feeling happy. I am loving photography.  It takes a great eye and mind to see it and realise what''s there. It takes a great photographer to capture and show us the experience before it becomes the unrecorded past.', '2007-06-04 13:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737223, 527625, 41794, '<td valign="top">Bugs are just a little too OOF for me.</td>', 'Bugs are just a little too OOF for me.', '2007-06-04 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737247, 527641, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space.</td>', 'Great use of negative space.', '2007-06-04 14:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737254, 527034, 41794, '<td valign="top">I really like how not only are the both sleeping, but they are both posed the same way - the angle of the head and neck and even their legs.</td>', 'I really like how not only are the both sleeping, but they are both posed the same way - the angle of the head and neck and even their legs.', '2007-06-04 14:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737334, 527645, 57519, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity in this. Also like your play with shadows.</td>', 'I like the simplicity in this. Also like your play with shadows.', '2007-06-04 14:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737350, 522509, 66223, '<td valign="top">great colors and sharpness.  i especially like the border that you used</td>', 'great colors and sharpness.  i especially like the border that you used', '2007-06-04 14:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737360, 526995, 57519, '<td valign="top">I don''t mean to be picky, but I feel you could''ve worked a bit more on the erasing of the blur layer. We can see the girl beside the right staffer pretty clearly, and his right shoulder is still blurred. I also would''ve straightened the pic to get the lamp posts perfectly horizontal. Just small details you have to look out for.</td>', 'I don''t mean to be picky, but I feel you could''ve worked a bit more on the erasing of the blur layer. We can see the girl beside the right staffer pretty clearly, and his right shoulder is still blurred. I also would''ve straightened the pic to get the lamp posts perfectly horizontal. Just small details you have to look out for.', '2007-06-04 14:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737363, 526984, 57519, '<td valign="top">nice lighting here.</td>', 'nice lighting here.', '2007-06-04 14:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737370, 527657, 57519, '<td valign="top">Dang, I would''ve loved to see the colors on these. It''s a real nice capture and I like the shadows.</td>', 'Dang, I would''ve loved to see the colors on these. It''s a real nice capture and I like the shadows.', '2007-06-04 14:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737378, 526706, 53964, '<td valign="top">Does she know how you''ve portrayed her?</td>', 'Does she know how you''ve portrayed her?', '2007-06-04 14:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737387, 527181, 57519, '<td valign="top">But... There''s only 1 and 1/2. I think the DOF is a bit too narrow, making the foreground pill a bit out of focus. I also think that this pill needs just a bit more light.</td>', 'But... There''s only 1 and 1/2. I think the DOF is a bit too narrow, making the foreground pill a bit out of focus. I also think that this pill needs just a bit more light.', '2007-06-04 14:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3737397, 526999, 57519, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t really "get" this image. Your lighting is ok, your dof is ok. It''s just that I think I''m looking for a story, or a feeling, and I can''t find it here.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t really "get" this image. Your lighting is ok, your dof is ok. It''s just that I think I''m looking for a story, or a feeling, and I can''t find it here.', '2007-06-04 14:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
