(3739904, 525817, 78255, '<td valign="top">Wow now this is a GRAND lightening shot. Great work!</td>', 'Wow now this is a GRAND lightening shot. Great work!', '2007-06-04 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3739930, 524783, 78255, '<td valign="top">Interesting the way these two almost look like a flower. I hope you were a comfortable distance away from them. Very good double take.</td>', 'Interesting the way these two almost look like a flower. I hope you were a comfortable distance away from them. Very good double take.', '2007-06-05 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3739951, 527505, 40430, '<td valign="top">the lighting seems a little flat but great composition</td>', 'the lighting seems a little flat but great composition', '2007-06-05 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3739968, 527685, 78255, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. Good luck!</td>', 'Great idea and well executed. Good luck!', '2007-06-05 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3739976, 525842, 78255, '<td valign="top">The two woman add to the shot. You have a double double take. Nice.</td>', 'The two woman add to the shot. You have a double double take. Nice.', '2007-06-05 00:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3739990, 524988, 78255, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice pair of glasses. I bet this one is a stunner printed.</td>', 'Quite a nice pair of glasses. I bet this one is a stunner printed.', '2007-06-05 00:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3739998, 527222, 57519, '<td valign="top">One of the coolest captures of horses I`ve seen in a long time!</td>', 'One of the coolest captures of horses I`ve seen in a long time!', '2007-06-05 00:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740011, 526321, 78255, '<td valign="top">Beautiful birds and they are posing so nicely for you. Pretty shot and good entry for the theme. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful birds and they are posing so nicely for you. Pretty shot and good entry for the theme. Good luck!', '2007-06-05 00:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740036, 527360, 57519, '<td valign="top">Intriguing..They kind of look pissed off. What did you do to them?</td>', 'Intriguing..They kind of look pissed off. What did you do to them?', '2007-06-05 00:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740041, 527333, 12268, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Might have been a bit more powerful at a different angle but I understand that might have been difficult to impossible. Perhaps a bump in the green hues might have added a bit of a pop. Otherwise a crisp shot.</td>', 'Nice capture. Might have been a bit more powerful at a different angle but I understand that might have been difficult to impossible. Perhaps a bump in the green hues might have added a bit of a pop. Otherwise a crisp shot.', '2007-06-05 00:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740043, 527334, 57519, '<td valign="top">I feel that better lighting would`ve brought out the glasses a bit more.</td>', 'I feel that better lighting would`ve brought out the glasses a bit more.', '2007-06-05 00:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740044, 526999, 78255, '<td valign="top">The colors are really wonderful in this image. I am not sure about the composition though. But not knowing what is to the left or right no way to know if there would be a better vantage for the image.</td>', 'The colors are really wonderful in this image. I am not sure about the composition though. But not knowing what is to the left or right no way to know if there would be a better vantage for the image.', '2007-06-05 00:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740053, 527573, 57519, '<td valign="top">Don`t be afraid to bump up the saturation when the colors are "plain"</td>', 'Don`t be afraid to bump up the saturation when the colors are "plain"', '2007-06-05 00:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740055, 527655, 12268, '<td valign="top">Very unusal flower shot. Very symetrical. The negative space is nice but I can see some noise in it, mostly blue. Perhaps a dupe layer to remove that by decreasind blues or levels to make it black. Otherwise a nice original idea.</td>', 'Very unusal flower shot. Very symetrical. The negative space is nice but I can see some noise in it, mostly blue. Perhaps a dupe layer to remove that by decreasind blues or levels to make it black. Otherwise a nice original idea.', '2007-06-05 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740059, 527620, 57519, '<td valign="top">You got nice colors out of this capture.</td>', 'You got nice colors out of this capture.', '2007-06-05 00:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740061, 527554, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here tho the composition of the shot makes it hard to fix the eye one place. Seems to lack a focal point.</td>', 'I like the idea here tho the composition of the shot makes it hard to fix the eye one place. Seems to lack a focal point.', '2007-06-05 00:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740069, 527694, 12268, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot going on here. The blown out parts of the carpet is very distracting. If the film rolls are the focal points then they are a bit out of focus. The reflection of the rolls (if that what it is) is a nice sublte addition to the pic.</td>', 'There''s a lot going on here. The blown out parts of the carpet is very distracting. If the film rolls are the focal points then they are a bit out of focus. The reflection of the rolls (if that what it is) is a nice sublte addition to the pic.', '2007-06-05 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740082, 527677, 57519, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don`t really see the Double Take in this capture.</td>', 'Sorry, I don`t really see the Double Take in this capture.', '2007-06-05 00:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740086, 527211, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the calm in the foreground and the drama in the far background. Nice black &amp; white capture and a good nifty take for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the calm in the foreground and the drama in the far background. Nice black & white capture and a good nifty take for this challenge.', '2007-06-05 00:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740095, 527210, 57519, '<td valign="top">I wish that diamond had been in better focus! Looks real nice.</td>', 'I wish that diamond had been in better focus! Looks real nice.', '2007-06-05 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740099, 527242, 78255, '<td valign="top">What a great shot. We the same model as the red one in our backyard. I think I may have thought it was cooler than my youngest son did when he received it. Good take on the theme.</td>', 'What a great shot. We the same model as the red one in our backyard. I think I may have thought it was cooler than my youngest son did when he received it. Good take on the theme.', '2007-06-05 00:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740101, 527152, 57519, '<td valign="top">Gee...Real nice textures!</td>', 'Gee...Real nice textures!', '2007-06-05 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740104, 527415, 12268, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The expressions seem to bevery similar as well. In my experience, having subjects at different distances from the lens makes it very hard to have uniform focus/sharpness. While the subject on the left is a bit more sharp, the subject on the left is not outrageiously out of focus. Good job on this as it is hard to do.</td>', 'Interesting. The expressions seem to bevery similar as well. In my experience, having subjects at different distances from the lens makes it very hard to have uniform focus/sharpness. While the subject on the left is a bit more sharp, the subject on the left is not outrageiously out of focus. Good job on this as it is hard to do.', '2007-06-05 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740110, 527414, 12268, '<td valign="top">Wicked capture! Good luck!</td>', 'Wicked capture! Good luck!', '2007-06-05 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740114, 527590, 57519, '<td valign="top">Nice and refreshing interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice and refreshing interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-06-05 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740115, 525890, 78255, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image that holds my attention and makes me look closer.</td>', 'Very interesting image that holds my attention and makes me look closer.', '2007-06-05 00:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740125, 527665, 12268, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge. I like it very much. Sorry if you are getting ripped on technicalities for not shooting a literal representation of the challenge. The title is very apt as well. Good stuff!</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge. I like it very much. Sorry if you are getting ripped on technicalities for not shooting a literal representation of the challenge. The title is very apt as well. Good stuff!', '2007-06-05 00:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740127, 527504, 57519, '<td valign="top">Very nice editing!</td>', 'Very nice editing!', '2007-06-05 00:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740132, 526706, 57519, '<td valign="top">She better not find out you`re saying this about her...You`ll be stuck with chips as your bedmate!</td>', 'She better not find out you`re saying this about her...You`ll be stuck with chips as your bedmate!', '2007-06-05 00:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740135, 526772, 12268, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I typicaly do not like flower shots but this is exceptional. Great composition and lighting. It''s got a very soft feel to it. Tolstoy said that art is defined by expressing a feeling that then can be shared with others. I think this is a nice example of this definition. Well done &amp; good luck!</td>', 'Very nice. I typicaly do not like flower shots but this is exceptional. Great composition and lighting. It''s got a very soft feel to it. Tolstoy said that art is defined by expressing a feeling that then can be shared with others. I think this is a nice example of this definition. Well done & good luck!', '2007-06-05 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740137, 527672, 78255, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well done.</td>', 'Good idea and well done.', '2007-06-05 00:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740142, 527542, 57519, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but not the background.</td>', 'I like the concept, but not the background.', '2007-06-05 00:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740147, 525406, 57519, '<td valign="top">I feel it lacks focus. Maybe the lighting is a bit off too.</td>', 'I feel it lacks focus. Maybe the lighting is a bit off too.', '2007-06-05 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3740150, 527350, 78255, '<td valign="top">A double Double Take. Strange, bizarre and thought provoking image. I like it.</td>', 'A double Double Take. Strange, bizarre and thought provoking image. I like it.', '2007-06-05 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
