(3740162, 527452, 14476, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast between the water and the critters and this would really be a fantastic keeper.   Still, it must have been fun getting it - with a long lens, I hope.</td>', 'A little more contrast between the water and the critters and this would really be a fantastic keeper.   Still, it must have been fun getting it - with a long lens, I hope.', '2007-06-05 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
