(3740749, 527517, 79403, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting shot; however, I would have touched the photo up differently.  The top left corner is overexposed and the picture gets lost with the black border (I''m not sure if you intentionally did this).  I would''ve liked to see the image cropped a little bit more (just the slightest bit) to get the two pedestrians taken out and get the bikers zoomed in.  I also would like to have seen this shot with a larger aperature to soften some of the background a bit.  I like this concept though...</td>', 'I think this is an interesting shot; however, I would have touched the photo up differently.  The top left corner is overexposed and the picture gets lost with the black border (I''m not sure if you intentionally did this).  I would''ve liked to see the image cropped a little bit more (just the slightest bit) to get the two pedestrians taken out and get the bikers zoomed in.  I also would like to have seen this shot with a larger aperature to soften some of the background a bit.  I like this concept though...', '2007-06-05 07:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
