(3741851, 526900, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>I can''t really think of much else to say except nice job. I really like how the starfish are so bright compared to the rest of the image. Nice work.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 I can''t really think of much else to say except nice job. I really like how the starfish are so bright compared to the rest of the image. Nice work.', '2007-06-05 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
