(3742384, 526787, 67152, '<td valign="top">I originally gave it a 7 - middle of the road but I went back through these images and realized how good this photo is...absolutely perfect for this challenge.  It tells a very subtle story and follows the best concepts of the challenge.  10.  My personal favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'I originally gave it a 7 - middle of the road but I went back through these images and realized how good this photo is...absolutely perfect for this challenge.  It tells a very subtle story and follows the best concepts of the challenge.  10.  My personal favorite in the challenge.', '2007-06-05 16:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
