(3743598, 527001, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>I really like the color combination for this shot, but think that it is a bit too contrasty, with a few blown-out highlights. The placement of the peppers is good, but the crop is a bit too tight for my liking. This gives off the appearance of a stock photo, and to really make that work well I think some of the shadows need to be eliminated also. Maybe a more diffused light source or two would help out with that.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 I really like the color combination for this shot, but think that it is a bit too contrasty, with a few blown-out highlights. The placement of the peppers is good, but the crop is a bit too tight for my liking. This gives off the appearance of a stock photo, and to really make that work well I think some of the shadows need to be eliminated also. Maybe a more diffused light source or two would help out with that.', '2007-06-05 21:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
