(3744070, 527211, 74015, '<td valign="top">Lots of things happening in this image... Love the cloud in the top left corner.  I would have cropped a bit at the bottom.  IMO, there is too much empty space in the bottom left corner.  I think it would have emphasized the relationship between the pigeons and the men.</td>', 'Lots of things happening in this image... Love the cloud in the top left corner.  I would have cropped a bit at the bottom.  IMO, there is too much empty space in the bottom left corner.  I think it would have emphasized the relationship between the pigeons and the men.', '2007-06-05 23:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
