(3744083, 526797, 74015, '<td valign="top">Even if this imgae sticks to the subject, I feel it is lacking a point.  To me, it is not telling or conveying anything.  The exposure''s good though and I like the green of the trees in the window.  With the distorsion of the glass, they get an impressionistic feel.</td>', 'Even if this imgae sticks to the subject, I feel it is lacking a point.  To me, it is not telling or conveying anything.  The exposure''s good though and I like the green of the trees in the window.  With the distorsion of the glass, they get an impressionistic feel.', '2007-06-05 23:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744090, 527261, 57882, '<td valign="top">This is a mezmorizing shot.  It is difficult to look away from this.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a mezmorizing shot.  It is difficult to look away from this.  Nicely done.', '2007-06-05 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744106, 527551, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, love the movement across the frame.</td>', 'Great action shot, love the movement across the frame.', '2007-06-05 23:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744130, 526783, 74015, '<td valign="top">There are lots of things that work for me in this image: the movement of the horses across the frame, the reflections in the water.  The only thing that bothers me is the white "bank" behind the horses.  Those highlights are blown out and they are distracting from the rest of the image.</td>', 'There are lots of things that work for me in this image: the movement of the horses across the frame, the reflections in the water.  The only thing that bothers me is the white "bank" behind the horses.  Those highlights are blown out and they are distracting from the rest of the image.', '2007-06-05 23:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744140, 526823, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2007-06-05 23:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
