(3744157, 527488, 74015, '<td valign="top">Very funny image and great model.</td>', 'Very funny image and great model.', '2007-06-05 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744160, 527226, 74015, '<td valign="top">The light that goes through their respective eye is exactly the same color.  This is a very striking image.</td>', 'The light that goes through their respective eye is exactly the same color.  This is a very striking image.', '2007-06-05 23:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744185, 524360, 74015, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I am distracted by the "vignetting" effect (or was it your lens?) around the frame or if it helps focus the attention on the center of the image?  Anyway, the image is very telling and it brings up all those story possibilities: were they fighting? the one on the right looks like it is giving a hard time to the one on the left and that poor one is trying to defend himself.  I can almost hear a dialogue going like this: "But mom! Everyone else is going!!".  Or maybe it''s just my life inspiring me this interpretation!! ;-)</td>', 'I''m not sure if I am distracted by the "vignetting" effect (or was it your lens?) around the frame or if it helps focus the attention on the center of the image?  Anyway, the image is very telling and it brings up all those story possibilities: were they fighting? the one on the right looks like it is giving a hard time to the one on the left and that poor one is trying to defend himself.  I can almost hear a dialogue going like this: "But mom! Everyone else is going!!".  Or maybe it''s just my life inspiring me this interpretation!! ;-)', '2007-06-05 23:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744212, 527226, 31637, '<td valign="top">perfect shot...10</td>', 'perfect shot...10', '2007-06-06 00:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744232, 526288, 74015, '<td valign="top">IMO this image is visually too busy.  It would have been more dynamic if you had shot up close.  The colors are pretty washed out too, probably due to the flat lighting.  There is no real contrast.  A bit more saturation and contrast in PP might have helped make the best of what your shooting day has given you (nobody controls the weather, right?).</td>', 'IMO this image is visually too busy.  It would have been more dynamic if you had shot up close.  The colors are pretty washed out too, probably due to the flat lighting.  There is no real contrast.  A bit more saturation and contrast in PP might have helped make the best of what your shooting day has given you (nobody controls the weather, right?).', '2007-06-06 00:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744250, 524792, 74015, '<td valign="top">I think it would be more dynamic if the ducks were not right in the middle of the image.  It would convey the sense of "chasing" you''re implying with your title.</td>', 'I think it would be more dynamic if the ducks were not right in the middle of the image.  It would convey the sense of "chasing" you''re implying with your title.', '2007-06-06 00:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744257, 527684, 74015, '<td valign="top">Clever use of light painting to fill up a negative space that would otherwise have been too distracting.  It also helps to bring the two sides of the image together.</td>', 'Clever use of light painting to fill up a negative space that would otherwise have been too distracting.  It also helps to bring the two sides of the image together.', '2007-06-06 00:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744276, 526704, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great shaft of light from the clouds.  A great capture.</td>', 'Great shaft of light from the clouds.  A great capture.', '2007-06-06 00:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744289, 527261, 70514, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the "Out of the Box" thinking here.  Very cool.</td>', 'I absolutely love the "Out of the Box" thinking here.  Very cool.', '2007-06-06 00:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744298, 527421, 74015, '<td valign="top">I love cats so I might not be objective in my voting.</td>', 'I love cats so I might not be objective in my voting.', '2007-06-06 00:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744307, 527317, 74015, '<td valign="top">Love the textures in the shells.</td>', 'Love the textures in the shells.', '2007-06-06 00:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744319, 527242, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great composition, clarity and dof.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great composition, clarity and dof.  Very nice.', '2007-06-06 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744343, 526140, 12268, '<td valign="top">Interesting make up here of the shot. I really like the shadow of the top dragonfly. Good conrol of dof and nice contrasting colours.</td>', 'Interesting make up here of the shot. I really like the shadow of the top dragonfly. Good conrol of dof and nice contrasting colours.', '2007-06-06 00:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744357, 524596, 12268, '<td valign="top">Awesome choice here for the challenge. I wish both were in focus as it really would have made the picture pop. The colours are really great and I love the golden tint. REally adds something to it.</td>', 'Awesome choice here for the challenge. I wish both were in focus as it really would have made the picture pop. The colours are really great and I love the golden tint. REally adds something to it.', '2007-06-06 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744358, 526883, 12268, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple &amp; crisp. Very original. Nice work! Good luck!</td>', 'Nice, simple & crisp. Very original. Nice work! Good luck!', '2007-06-06 00:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744397, 527049, 74015, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I am not seeing how this is an interpretation on Double Take...  The yellow is repeated more than twice in the image.  And if you were going for the yellow line on the ground being \"reflected\" by the dotted line on the train, I think it would have worked better if the train had been moving.  The blur would have emphasize the \"reflection\".  But please, disregard my comment if the double take is obvious to everyone but me (it happens sometimes...).<br/>PS: subject aside, I really like this image.  It has a lot to tell.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I am not seeing how this is an interpretation on Double Take...  The yellow is repeated more than twice in the image.  And if you were going for the yellow line on the ground being \"reflected\" by the dotted line on the train, I think it would have worked better if the train had been moving.  The blur would have emphasize the \"reflection\".  But please, disregard my comment if the double take is obvious to everyone but me (it happens sometimes...).PS: subject aside, I really like this image.  It has a lot to tell.', '2007-06-06 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744593, 524943, 69487, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Nissan Versa and a Mini Cooper Convertible WITH the top up and soft roof open......?</td>', 'Looks like a Nissan Versa and a Mini Cooper Convertible WITH the top up and soft roof open......?', '2007-06-06 01:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744858, 527211, 13207, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the bunch - original</td>', 'My favorite of the bunch - original', '2007-06-06 01:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745057, 525657, 31637, '<td valign="top">Super clear. you should be doing well. the red color is not a good choice, I think white would of worked better.</td>', 'Super clear. you should be doing well. the red color is not a good choice, I think white would of worked better.', '2007-06-06 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745122, 527619, 73829, '<td valign="top">Engines pumping and thumping in time. My favorite band!</td>', 'Engines pumping and thumping in time. My favorite band!', '2007-06-06 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745272, 527414, 64458, '<td valign="top">Very nice! And cute!   :)</td>', 'Very nice! And cute!   :)', '2007-06-06 02:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745286, 527641, 64458, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. The composition works for me and the color is very soothing.</td>', 'I really like this image. The composition works for me and the color is very soothing.', '2007-06-06 02:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745301, 526658, 64458, '<td valign="top">Clean selective desaturation. I also like the composition.</td>', 'Clean selective desaturation. I also like the composition.', '2007-06-06 02:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745317, 522509, 57775, '<td valign="top">Great!  Creative composition, crisp shot, cute title, interesting border... hope you ribbon.</td>', 'Great!  Creative composition, crisp shot, cute title, interesting border... hope you ribbon.', '2007-06-06 03:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745324, 526971, 57775, '<td valign="top">Really amazing shot - I see a ribbon in your future.</td>', 'Really amazing shot - I see a ribbon in your future.', '2007-06-06 03:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3745327, 525835, 64458, '<td valign="top">It''s one of my favorite spots to take pictures in San Diego! I like the composition. I can see this image even looking better in black and white actually...</td>', 'It''s one of my favorite spots to take pictures in San Diego! I like the composition. I can see this image even looking better in black and white actually...', '2007-06-06 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
