(3751171, 526706, 74979, '<td valign="top">tacky tacky...<br/>photograph feels snapshot-like, lighting and focus on her facial features could be better.  The boke behind her face also is distracting.</td>', 'tacky tacky...photograph feels snapshot-like, lighting and focus on her facial features could be better.  The boke behind her face also is distracting.', '2007-06-07 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751331, 527174, 29011, '<td valign="top">I really like the warmness and country feeling of a shot. Berries on a summer day? can''t beat that. Only wish the photo was sharper, more in focus on the berries.</td>', 'I really like the warmness and country feeling of a shot. Berries on a summer day? can''t beat that. Only wish the photo was sharper, more in focus on the berries.', '2007-06-07 12:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751336, 527334, 29011, '<td valign="top">oooh, nice abstract here. With just a sliver of the rim in focus. You did a great job with the composition.</td>', 'oooh, nice abstract here. With just a sliver of the rim in focus. You did a great job with the composition.', '2007-06-07 12:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751344, 527619, 29011, '<td valign="top">Awesome haha. Very clever! :)<br/>Did you get the big car or little car for the challenge ;)</td>', 'Awesome haha. Very clever! :)Did you get the big car or little car for the challenge ;)', '2007-06-07 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751366, 527625, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the two hoverflies. Wish there was some more detail in the shot. I do like the capture of the moment. Nice timing there. Looks like some high pass sharpen was used? created the halo around the bug on the left.</td>', 'Nice capture of the two hoverflies. Wish there was some more detail in the shot. I do like the capture of the moment. Nice timing there. Looks like some high pass sharpen was used? created the halo around the bug on the left.', '2007-06-07 12:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751377, 525842, 29011, '<td valign="top">What humor! :) Nice catching the two old ladies there. Though the shot could use some contrast/brightness adjustments. Looks a bit too dark for this kind of shot.</td>', 'What humor! :) Nice catching the two old ladies there. Though the shot could use some contrast/brightness adjustments. Looks a bit too dark for this kind of shot.', '2007-06-07 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751380, 527355, 29011, '<td valign="top">Awesome! great lighting and PP to bring out the textures. Reminds me of The Discovery channel ads with the hand painting and gesture technique mimicing animals.</td>', 'Awesome! great lighting and PP to bring out the textures. Reminds me of The Discovery channel ads with the hand painting and gesture technique mimicing animals.', '2007-06-07 12:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751387, 527595, 29011, '<td valign="top">I see two, but pitty the other horse is in the shadows like that. Makes it hard to see , almost as if she/he wasn''t there.</td>', 'I see two, but pitty the other horse is in the shadows like that. Makes it hard to see , almost as if she/he wasn''t there.', '2007-06-07 12:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751396, 527346, 71958, '<td valign="top">i like this idea a lot.  i would like the see less distracting backgorounds in both cases.</td>', 'i like this idea a lot.  i would like the see less distracting backgorounds in both cases.', '2007-06-07 12:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751405, 527175, 70514, '<td valign="top">I think it''s really cute how the babies are mocking their parents postures as well.  Nice composition.</td>', 'I think it''s really cute how the babies are mocking their parents postures as well.  Nice composition.', '2007-06-07 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751406, 526287, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love this type of processing.  Very nice composition as well.</td>', 'I love this type of processing.  Very nice composition as well.', '2007-06-07 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751409, 527338, 71958, '<td valign="top">nice concept.  since the apples are the subject (in the title) I wish they were the focal point.  maybe slightly more DOF improves that.</td>', 'nice concept.  since the apples are the subject (in the title) I wish they were the focal point.  maybe slightly more DOF improves that.', '2007-06-07 12:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
