(3751431, 527346, 70514, '<td valign="top">I think this might''ve worked better (imo only) if the background of the picture matched the background of your image (like either both images with the blinds or the door).  It''s a good idea though.</td>', 'I think this might''ve worked better (imo only) if the background of the picture matched the background of your image (like either both images with the blinds or the door).  It''s a good idea though.', '2007-06-07 12:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751433, 527484, 70514, '<td valign="top">The focus on the eyes seems a bit soft, imo.</td>', 'The focus on the eyes seems a bit soft, imo.', '2007-06-07 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751434, 526594, 71958, '<td valign="top">very nice.  it looks like the red of the flag is bleeding into the skin color on the hand.  with the advanced editing rules you could have fixed that up, but i like this a lot.  nice work.</td>', 'very nice.  it looks like the red of the flag is bleeding into the skin color on the hand.  with the advanced editing rules you could have fixed that up, but i like this a lot.  nice work.', '2007-06-07 12:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751436, 525817, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great timing!  Very nice image.</td>', 'Great timing!  Very nice image.', '2007-06-07 12:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751439, 527319, 66353, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and good composition :)</td>', 'Wonderful colors and good composition :)', '2007-06-07 12:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751440, 527541, 71958, '<td valign="top">the bent toes on the one foot throw off the symmetry, but this is nicely executed.</td>', 'the bent toes on the one foot throw off the symmetry, but this is nicely executed.', '2007-06-07 12:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751445, 526806, 66193, '<td valign="top">to me, there''s just too much empty space.  I understand what you were attempting.  I would have preferred just a little more cropped off the top.  Still leaving a ratio of 6:1, sky to sand.  Either way, a nice shot!</td>', 'to me, there''s just too much empty space.  I understand what you were attempting.  I would have preferred just a little more cropped off the top.  Still leaving a ratio of 6:1, sky to sand.  Either way, a nice shot!', '2007-06-07 12:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751451, 526962, 66353, '<td valign="top">Cute fellows - and good composition and color...</td>', 'Cute fellows - and good composition and color...', '2007-06-07 12:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751452, 527511, 71958, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but i am not a big fan of such extreme lighting here.</td>', 'nice composition, but i am not a big fan of such extreme lighting here.', '2007-06-07 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751453, 525664, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Cute pose.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Cute pose.', '2007-06-07 12:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751456, 526929, 66353, '<td valign="top">Pretty - and perfect DOF</td>', 'Pretty - and perfect DOF', '2007-06-07 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751458, 527394, 71958, '<td valign="top">i like this cause it made me laugh... nice composition, and nicely executed.</td>', 'i like this cause it made me laugh... nice composition, and nicely executed.', '2007-06-07 12:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751460, 527213, 71958, '<td valign="top">both sets of feet seem out of focus.</td>', 'both sets of feet seem out of focus.', '2007-06-07 12:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751461, 526769, 66193, '<td valign="top">kind of funny!  looks underexposed, though.  If you metered off the white bunny, it will set exposure settings to make that 18% gray, resulting in overall underexposure.  composition looks good.  the DOF is about right, too.  focus is on the eyes, funny title.  summary - everything looks good except for expsoure.  Nice pic overall.</td>', 'kind of funny!  looks underexposed, though.  If you metered off the white bunny, it will set exposure settings to make that 18% gray, resulting in overall underexposure.  composition looks good.  the DOF is about right, too.  focus is on the eyes, funny title.  summary - everything looks good except for expsoure.  Nice pic overall.', '2007-06-07 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751465, 527616, 71958, '<td valign="top">nicely executed but the subject doesn''t really do anythign for me.</td>', 'nicely executed but the subject doesn''t really do anythign for me.', '2007-06-07 12:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751466, 526248, 66193, '<td valign="top">probably should''ve taken those dragonflies out and put them in a more interesting surroundings.  the background is too busy, and detracts from your main subject.</td>', 'probably should''ve taken those dragonflies out and put them in a more interesting surroundings.  the background is too busy, and detracts from your main subject.', '2007-06-07 12:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751471, 526806, 71958, '<td valign="top">the negative space works here. nicely done.</td>', 'the negative space works here. nicely done.', '2007-06-07 12:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751472, 526296, 66353, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about your processing. I would rather have seen this just with the brown/yellow tint or in B&amp;W and without the saturated car.</td>', 'Not crazy about your processing. I would rather have seen this just with the brown/yellow tint or in B&W and without the saturated car.', '2007-06-07 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751473, 527597, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done and composed.</td>', 'Wonderfully done and composed.', '2007-06-07 12:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751475, 527562, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp color and composition.  This is great!</td>', 'I like the sharp color and composition.  This is great!', '2007-06-07 12:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751476, 526650, 66193, '<td valign="top">very cute.  I like how you got them to pose like that!  Lighting looks a little flat,though.  could have used a little more pop, either through a curves adjustment for contrast, and hue/sat or channel mixer for a touch more color.</td>', 'very cute.  I like how you got them to pose like that!  Lighting looks a little flat,though.  could have used a little more pop, either through a curves adjustment for contrast, and hue/sat or channel mixer for a touch more color.', '2007-06-07 12:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751477, 523399, 71958, '<td valign="top">this has too much of a snap shot feel.</td>', 'this has too much of a snap shot feel.', '2007-06-07 12:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751481, 525645, 71958, '<td valign="top">not a fan of this processing.  it is a cool effect, but don''t kow if it fits here.</td>', 'not a fan of this processing.  it is a cool effect, but don''t kow if it fits here.', '2007-06-07 12:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751484, 527116, 66193, '<td valign="top">focus looks OK.  the shallow DOF, likely used to isolate subjects from background, lets that left hand snail get a little OOF.  Also, be aware of the rest of the frame (like the edge of the blue, and the distracting square of white in the top left).  A flat (not shiny) surface might have worked better here.</td>', 'focus looks OK.  the shallow DOF, likely used to isolate subjects from background, lets that left hand snail get a little OOF.  Also, be aware of the rest of the frame (like the edge of the blue, and the distracting square of white in the top left).  A flat (not shiny) surface might have worked better here.', '2007-06-07 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751488, 527334, 66353, '<td valign="top">Blurry and out of focus - and I really like it :)<br/>Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Blurry and out of focus - and I really like it :)Nice take on the challenge.', '2007-06-07 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751498, 525657, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice handle on DOF.</td>', 'nice handle on DOF.', '2007-06-07 12:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751499, 526759, 70514, '<td valign="top">I thought of doing this same type of image, but the problems I had with it I''m seeing here (imo) which is why I didn''t go this route.  It seems that either the WB is off, or maybe it''s just because the sky is so vast against such thin subjects.  Anyway, it just all kind of meshes together, and it''s really kind of bright.  I think you did a great job with the composition though. Again, this is just my opinion.</td>', 'I thought of doing this same type of image, but the problems I had with it I''m seeing here (imo) which is why I didn''t go this route.  It seems that either the WB is off, or maybe it''s just because the sky is so vast against such thin subjects.  Anyway, it just all kind of meshes together, and it''s really kind of bright.  I think you did a great job with the composition though. Again, this is just my opinion.', '2007-06-07 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751503, 526658, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this one.  just a touch more DOF would have helped.</td>', 'I like the lines in this one.  just a touch more DOF would have helped.', '2007-06-07 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751504, 526898, 66353, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I ever want to look at another drop shot - and I know I''m not going to vote on any. We''ve seen far too many of those lately in my opinion. So, even though your picture might be technically well done I''ll not cast a vote...</td>', 'I don''t think I ever want to look at another drop shot - and I know I''m not going to vote on any. We''ve seen far too many of those lately in my opinion. So, even though your picture might be technically well done I''ll not cast a vote...', '2007-06-07 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751506, 527519, 70514, '<td valign="top">I can''t get over how clear that water is. Truly a beautiful image.  Nice composition and clarity.</td>', 'I can''t get over how clear that water is. Truly a beautiful image.  Nice composition and clarity.', '2007-06-07 12:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751509, 527683, 70514, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go pick tomatoes!</td>', 'Makes me want to go pick tomatoes!', '2007-06-07 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751511, 527154, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the grain in this one.  maybe a touch too bright near the heads, but it looks like it was a very tough lighting situation anyway.  pretty good handling that.</td>', 'I like the grain in this one.  maybe a touch too bright near the heads, but it looks like it was a very tough lighting situation anyway.  pretty good handling that.', '2007-06-07 12:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751512, 527325, 66193, '<td valign="top">nicely composed.  the difference in lighting of the two flowers bothers me a little though.  I would have liked to see the top flower a little brighter.</td>', 'nicely composed.  the difference in lighting of the two flowers bothers me a little though.  I would have liked to see the top flower a little brighter.', '2007-06-07 12:48:57.000000', NULL, 1);
