(3751525, 527077, 70514, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture of motion here!  Unless they were being held by strings and you cloned them, lol!  Either way, I think this is funny, sharp and has nice dof and composition.</td>', 'Awesome capture of motion here!  Unless they were being held by strings and you cloned them, lol!  Either way, I think this is funny, sharp and has nice dof and composition.', '2007-06-07 12:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3751527, 527157, 66193, '<td valign="top">pretty boring subject.  tough to make this one look good.  The lighting is also a little unidirectional, judging by the shadows.  try using another light, or at least a reflector (can even be a piece of white cardboard or paper) to help even out the light.  To improve this (forgetting about the subject), add in some more contrast and overall lighting through curves and levels adjustments.</td>', 'pretty boring subject.  tough to make this one look good.  The lighting is also a little unidirectional, judging by the shadows.  try using another light, or at least a reflector (can even be a piece of white cardboard or paper) to help even out the light.  To improve this (forgetting about the subject), add in some more contrast and overall lighting through curves and levels adjustments.', '2007-06-07 12:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
