(3752307, 527619, 62187, '<td valign="top">engines pumping and thumping in time, the green light flashes, the flags go up, churning and burning the reach for the cup. Cake - nobody knows that song - too cool! It''s not the greatest photo: too much blue in the rims of the big car. I think some burning might have also helped in the body. I like frames, I almost always think they improve the overall image. But, you''ve got a great observation here and too funny! There is really nice focus on the toy car and nice dof. I hope it does well for you!</td>', 'engines pumping and thumping in time, the green light flashes, the flags go up, churning and burning the reach for the cup. Cake - nobody knows that song - too cool! It''s not the greatest photo: too much blue in the rims of the big car. I think some burning might have also helped in the body. I like frames, I almost always think they improve the overall image. But, you''ve got a great observation here and too funny! There is really nice focus on the toy car and nice dof. I hope it does well for you!', '2007-06-07 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752308, 527678, 57519, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Kinda gives you vertigo.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Kinda gives you vertigo.', '2007-06-07 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752315, 527652, 70514, '<td valign="top">The first time I saw this, I didn''t see the guy in the tree.  I come back, and yes, I''m creeped out, lol!  I liked the processing a lot, which is why I came back.  I was just so drawn to the guy on the ground.  Anyway, nicely done.</td>', 'The first time I saw this, I didn''t see the guy in the tree.  I come back, and yes, I''m creeped out, lol!  I liked the processing a lot, which is why I came back.  I was just so drawn to the guy on the ground.  Anyway, nicely done.', '2007-06-07 15:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752321, 527638, 57519, '<td valign="top">Interesting...Such pretty eyes, and they''re almost identical. I also like the crop . You can really tell they''re sisters.</td>', 'Interesting...Such pretty eyes, and they''re almost identical. I also like the crop . You can really tell they''re sisters.', '2007-06-07 15:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
