(3756109, 527100, 28070, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about the color shift or whatever it is, but it is a great idea for a double take.  Might be better with both kids in there.  And the one is covering the pin on the left.  Oh you know I bet a fish eye lens would get a good take on this.</td>', 'I don''t know about the color shift or whatever it is, but it is a great idea for a double take.  Might be better with both kids in there.  And the one is covering the pin on the left.  Oh you know I bet a fish eye lens would get a good take on this.', '2007-06-08 04:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3756110, 527304, 28070, '<td valign="top">Very Cool.  Kind of painting-like.  So I assume you used some art filter or something.  The top of the wavy object is cut off.  They line up nice through the frame.  Colors are somewhat dull (maybe just my monitor).  The lighting on the wavy object is dark on the left side of it.</td>', 'Very Cool.  Kind of painting-like.  So I assume you used some art filter or something.  The top of the wavy object is cut off.  They line up nice through the frame.  Colors are somewhat dull (maybe just my monitor).  The lighting on the wavy object is dark on the left side of it.', '2007-06-08 04:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3756113, 527484, 28070, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up.  A little overexposed I think in the eyes there.</td>', 'Nice close-up.  A little overexposed I think in the eyes there.', '2007-06-08 04:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3756115, 527606, 28070, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Nice line up in the frame.  I am picking up some off-white around in the white background.  Try the levels white eye-dropper.</td>', 'Cool.  Nice line up in the frame.  I am picking up some off-white around in the white background.  Try the levels white eye-dropper.', '2007-06-08 05:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
