(3757100, 527619, 15204, '<td valign="top">I think the puddle unfortunately throws the effect off a little here.  Without the ''double take'' and mini car in there, the puddle works well.  Here it kind of separated the two cars and the extra set of wheels is distracting. 6 from me.</td>', 'I think the puddle unfortunately throws the effect off a little here.  Without the ''double take'' and mini car in there, the puddle works well.  Here it kind of separated the two cars and the extra set of wheels is distracting. 6 from me.', '2007-06-08 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757119, 527350, 69556, '<td valign="top">This is very original.  I like orgionality!  Would be great if you could get this shot with live animals.  I think the only two things I would have changed about this shot is that 1. you can tell it''s taken on a table, because I can see the edge of the table on the left. 2. I don''t really care for the zebra cloth, I think it is kind of distracting.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'This is very original.  I like orgionality!  Would be great if you could get this shot with live animals.  I think the only two things I would have changed about this shot is that 1. you can tell it''s taken on a table, because I can see the edge of the table on the left. 2. I don''t really care for the zebra cloth, I think it is kind of distracting.  Keep up the good work.', '2007-06-08 12:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757126, 525693, 69556, '<td valign="top">Nice shot you used the double take 5 times in this shot.  Great use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Nice shot you used the double take 5 times in this shot.  Great use of the rule of thirds.', '2007-06-08 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
