(3759150, 524274, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting and sharpness, appealing reflection in the lenses, and the red and green complement each other.</td>', 'Very good lighting and sharpness, appealing reflection in the lenses, and the red and green complement each other.', '2007-06-09 00:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759159, 527386, 61961, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge very well.  The symmetry is somewhat marred because the eco bulb seems to be illuminated, while the other does not (and also appears to tilt a bit).</td>', 'Fits the challenge very well.  The symmetry is somewhat marred because the eco bulb seems to be illuminated, while the other does not (and also appears to tilt a bit).', '2007-06-09 00:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759162, 526625, 67697, '<td valign="top">Quite an emotional pic.  The sky and the light streaming thru the clouds add a nice spiritual touch.  Good job of making the two plots stand out from the surrounding darkness.</td>', 'Quite an emotional pic.  The sky and the light streaming thru the clouds add a nice spiritual touch.  Good job of making the two plots stand out from the surrounding darkness.', '2007-06-09 00:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759163, 524360, 67697, '<td valign="top">Funny, great catch!</td>', 'Funny, great catch!', '2007-06-09 00:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759165, 527298, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  Love the perspective.</td>', 'Great catch.  Love the perspective.', '2007-06-09 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759167, 527596, 67697, '<td valign="top">That is one happy boy lol.  Very cute picture.</td>', 'That is one happy boy lol.  Very cute picture.', '2007-06-09 00:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759170, 527261, 61961, '<td valign="top">Greatly imaginative, though the technicals could use some improvement.  Really needs better lighting (a fill or reflected light from the right, I think).</td>', 'Greatly imaginative, though the technicals could use some improvement.  Really needs better lighting (a fill or reflected light from the right, I think).', '2007-06-09 00:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759174, 527414, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t you just loooooove to know what the one on top is saying?  lol  Well, for sure, this is a very interesting picture lol.</td>', 'Wouldn''t you just loooooove to know what the one on top is saying?  lol  Well, for sure, this is a very interesting picture lol.', '2007-06-09 00:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759179, 527100, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Contrasting bowling balls and one pin reflection in each lane.  Great catch.</td>', 'Very cool.  Contrasting bowling balls and one pin reflection in each lane.  Great catch.', '2007-06-09 00:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759188, 527149, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how the two just pop out of the pic.</td>', 'I love how the two just pop out of the pic.', '2007-06-09 00:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759193, 527672, 67697, '<td valign="top">Must be a good book because you both seem to be enjoying it. lol.  Cute idea!</td>', 'Must be a good book because you both seem to be enjoying it. lol.  Cute idea!', '2007-06-09 00:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759219, 527424, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Love the reflections.</td>', 'Very cool.  Love the reflections.', '2007-06-09 00:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759235, 526415, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love that you caught both men in near perfect alignment.  But the billboards to the left are a distraction to the subject.  Lots of stuff to look at for sure!</td>', 'I love that you caught both men in near perfect alignment.  But the billboards to the left are a distraction to the subject.  Lots of stuff to look at for sure!', '2007-06-09 00:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759253, 525817, 77021, '<td valign="top">phenomenal.</td>', 'phenomenal.', '2007-06-09 00:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3759263, 526321, 67697, '<td valign="top">Pretty birds.  I love how they look soft and furry.  Great background.</td>', 'Pretty birds.  I love how they look soft and furry.  Great background.', '2007-06-09 00:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
