(3761704, 525693, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great use of a lot of doubles, with the ever so slightly offset handle to the espresso maker.  The one (probably odd) thing that stands out to me is that for such an elaborate setup with the fancy espresso machine, lovely saucers etc., there are those two pre-packaged goofy cookies with little candies in them.  I would have expected some freshly made biscotti or something instead (not that I wouldn''t eat the cookies anyway!)  Great shot!</td>', 'Great use of a lot of doubles, with the ever so slightly offset handle to the espresso maker.  The one (probably odd) thing that stands out to me is that for such an elaborate setup with the fancy espresso machine, lovely saucers etc., there are those two pre-packaged goofy cookies with little candies in them.  I would have expected some freshly made biscotti or something instead (not that I wouldn''t eat the cookies anyway!)  Great shot!', '2007-06-09 23:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
