(3761903, 527663, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The lighting is pretty flat in this image. It looks like an attempt to be a product shot, but needs some work. The setup is nice, but the lighting just needs more work. The writing on the bottles is sharp, but the bottles appear to be blurred, almost like a gaussian blur was used. The lime adds a nice touch, but also lacks a certain punch.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The lighting is pretty flat in this image. It looks like an attempt to be a product shot, but needs some work. The setup is nice, but the lighting just needs more work. The writing on the bottles is sharp, but the bottles appear to be blurred, almost like a gaussian blur was used. The lime adds a nice touch, but also lacks a certain punch.', '2007-06-10 00:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761905, 527597, 48697, '<td valign="top">nice tone and composition!</td>', 'nice tone and composition!', '2007-06-10 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
