(3761919, 527181, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 0/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>It fits the challenge, but needs a lot of work. First of all, white on white, for the most part, does not work. It is extremely difficult to get it to work well, and takes a lot of preparation during the setup, and even more work during PP to make it turn out just right. The focus is soft throughout, and the DOF way too shallow. The lighting is very flat. The centered composition does not work well for this photo.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 0/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 It fits the challenge, but needs a lot of work. First of all, white on white, for the most part, does not work. It is extremely difficult to get it to work well, and takes a lot of preparation during the setup, and even more work during PP to make it turn out just right. The focus is soft throughout, and the DOF way too shallow. The lighting is very flat. The centered composition does not work well for this photo.', '2007-06-10 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761920, 525801, 48697, '<td valign="top">seems a bit dark</td>', 'seems a bit dark', '2007-06-10 01:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
