(3761927, 527291, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>I like the idea of an old, used and worn out pair of boots. Even the inclusion of the dog wasn''t a bad thing. I don''t like the crop. I think it is too tight for this shot. The setting also gives off more of a "snapshot" feel than it does a professional photograph. The dogs front let is overexposed. The photo seems sharp, but almost oversharpened after a slightly out of focus shot was taken.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 I like the idea of an old, used and worn out pair of boots. Even the inclusion of the dog wasn''t a bad thing. I don''t like the crop. I think it is too tight for this shot. The setting also gives off more of a "snapshot" feel than it does a professional photograph. The dogs front let is overexposed. The photo seems sharp, but almost oversharpened after a slightly out of focus shot was taken.', '2007-06-10 01:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761929, 526309, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>It just can''t get any better than this. Why can''t I think of stuff like this? Nice work.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 It just can''t get any better than this. Why can''t I think of stuff like this? Nice work.', '2007-06-10 01:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
