(3761933, 525954, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Excellent capture. I''d love to know how this was accomplished.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Excellent capture. I''d love to know how this was accomplished.', '2007-06-10 01:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761936, 527413, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice shot. The setup is good, but a little tight around the edges. The lighting is fairly even. The focus seems a bit soft for this shot to really stand out.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice shot. The setup is good, but a little tight around the edges. The lighting is fairly even. The focus seems a bit soft for this shot to really stand out.', '2007-06-10 01:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761941, 526624, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Creative shot. The limited DOF works extremely well here. The setup is good. The focus on the tools seems just a bit soft, or maybe my eyes are just going bad.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Creative shot. The limited DOF works extremely well here. The setup is good. The focus on the tools seems just a bit soft, or maybe my eyes are just going bad.', '2007-06-10 01:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761945, 524359, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>I like the high contrast on this shot. I like the composotion, especially the placement of your subjects in the frame. I think the motion blue could have been done away with, or panned better so that your taxis had a part of them in sharp focus.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 I like the high contrast on this shot. I like the composotion, especially the placement of your subjects in the frame. I think the motion blue could have been done away with, or panned better so that your taxis had a part of them in sharp focus.', '2007-06-10 01:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761956, 527075, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>I can''t see two of anything in this shot that presents itself as the subject in this shot. I obviously don''t know what I''m looking for, so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. The composition doesn''t include anything that says "Look at Me!" in it. My eyes wander the photo over and over again until I get frustrated and decide I have had enough. The shadows in the foreground are distracting since they don''t belong to anything in the photo.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 I can''t see two of anything in this shot that presents itself as the subject in this shot. I obviously don''t know what I''m looking for, so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. The composition doesn''t include anything that says "Look at Me!" in it. My eyes wander the photo over and over again until I get frustrated and decide I have had enough. The shadows in the foreground are distracting since they don''t belong to anything in the photo.', '2007-06-10 01:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761959, 527083, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Nice work on this shot.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Nice work on this shot.', '2007-06-10 01:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761965, 527353, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice idea. I love the reddish color on the right shoe. The fabric they are on is very distracting. It is an element in the phot that should be done away with. I think the square crop works well here, but would rather see a lower, head on angle, to eliminate the white insides of the shoes also. Maybe that would also help to reduce the glare on the shoes from the lighting.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice idea. I love the reddish color on the right shoe. The fabric they are on is very distracting. It is an element in the phot that should be done away with. I think the square crop works well here, but would rather see a lower, head on angle, to eliminate the white insides of the shoes also. Maybe that would also help to reduce the glare on the shoes from the lighting.', '2007-06-10 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3761967, 527100, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 0/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The blue duotone doesn''t work well for this image. Just a straight black and white would work better. The highlights and shadows both lose all detail. The empty space above the photo should be cropped, as well as the part of the person on the right.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 0/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The blue duotone doesn''t work well for this image. Just a straight black and white would work better. The highlights and shadows both lose all detail. The empty space above the photo should be cropped, as well as the part of the person on the right.', '2007-06-10 01:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3762006, 527696, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>I love the sky in this shot, I just wish the clouds didn''t lose detail above and to the left of the main snowman. The even lighting and shadows that are produces are awesome. Nice job.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 I love the sky in this shot, I just wish the clouds didn''t lose detail above and to the left of the main snowman. The even lighting and shadows that are produces are awesome. Nice job.', '2007-06-10 01:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3762019, 526287, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Ahhh. Tone mapping. I like the effect, but feel that this was overdone just a bit. The reason that I only scored it a 1 on criteria is that the second tractor is mostly hidden, and you have to search for it to begin with. It is not easily identified as a double of the first tractor at first glance of the photo. I think tone mapping is cool, but your sky suffered from it. It is very apparent that the sky doesn''t match the rest of the photo exactly. Other than that, the grass and tractor really come out well from it.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Ahhh. Tone mapping. I like the effect, but feel that this was overdone just a bit. The reason that I only scored it a 1 on criteria is that the second tractor is mostly hidden, and you have to search for it to begin with. It is not easily identified as a double of the first tractor at first glance of the photo. I think tone mapping is cool, but your sky suffered from it. It is very apparent that the sky doesn''t match the rest of the photo exactly. Other than that, the grass and tractor really come out well from it.', '2007-06-10 01:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3762020, 524360, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice job.', '2007-06-10 01:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
