(3762037, 526557, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>I think the composition, with the empty space at the top, works well. The DOF is a little too shallow. I would like to see the entire zipper in complete focus.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 I think the composition, with the empty space at the top, works well. The DOF is a little too shallow. I would like to see the entire zipper in complete focus.', '2007-06-10 01:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3762047, 527055, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice close-up shot, and great idea. The cropping is great, with the semi-semmetrical image. The water drops are too messy and distracting. I don''t know exactly how to accomplish the perfect setup for something like that. Maybe using car wax on the cherries, and the a spray bottle. I like the highlight on the left cherry, and also the shadow. The right cherry doesn''t really have the same shadow, and the reflection of the light is stronger and not as smooth.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice close-up shot, and great idea. The cropping is great, with the semi-semmetrical image. The water drops are too messy and distracting. I don''t know exactly how to accomplish the perfect setup for something like that. Maybe using car wax on the cherries, and the a spray bottle. I like the highlight on the left cherry, and also the shadow. The right cherry doesn''t really have the same shadow, and the reflection of the light is stronger and not as smooth.', '2007-06-10 01:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
