(3762206, 527211, 79242, '<td valign="top">This really is one of my favorite photos in the double take shoot, although I am not 100% sure why, because there are a couple of things that I do not like. There is IMO too much empty space at the bottom of the photo. I think the photo is actually better because my monitor cannot display the whole thing. Personally I would crop half of the empty space beneath the birds. It also feels like the photo is a little unbalanced. Maybe it is the angle of the fence that throws it off. I really do like it though, so those are minor complaints.</td>', 'This really is one of my favorite photos in the double take shoot, although I am not 100% sure why, because there are a couple of things that I do not like. There is IMO too much empty space at the bottom of the photo. I think the photo is actually better because my monitor cannot display the whole thing. Personally I would crop half of the empty space beneath the birds. It also feels like the photo is a little unbalanced. Maybe it is the angle of the fence that throws it off. I really do like it though, so those are minor complaints.', '2007-06-10 03:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
