(3762869, 525842, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is simply too good for DPC.  I like the near B&amp;W of the scene and the quiet colors of the women.  Perfectly titled in a number of ways.  The mailboxes seem of the women''s era, yet the graffiti speaks of a disrespect that would not have been tolerated in their youth.</td>', 'This is simply too good for DPC.  I like the near B&W of the scene and the quiet colors of the women.  Perfectly titled in a number of ways.  The mailboxes seem of the women''s era, yet the graffiti speaks of a disrespect that would not have been tolerated in their youth.', '2007-06-10 12:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3762871, 526746, 42013, '<td valign="top">How lucky. Composition seems a bit static. Maybe it''s because the camera view is looking straight at the fern so the picture becomes somewhat two-diminsional.</td>', 'How lucky. Composition seems a bit static. Maybe it''s because the camera view is looking straight at the fern so the picture becomes somewhat two-diminsional.', '2007-06-10 12:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
