(3762939, 526356, 42013, '<td valign="top">Peppers have nice shapes and one thing you might consider next time is lighting from the side to give a little more depth to their contours. This picture looks like it was lit from overhead/straight on.</td>', 'Peppers have nice shapes and one thing you might consider next time is lighting from the side to give a little more depth to their contours. This picture looks like it was lit from overhead/straight on.', '2007-06-10 12:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
