(3763009, 527645, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great texture - I love the glass bottles!  Having the flower heads pointing different ways works well - and the title is great.  Wish there weren''t quite such a different between the lighting on the left and right flowers - makes my eye feel the one on the left is too bright, the one on the right is too dark - and neither is really too anything except in contrast with eachother.</td>', 'Great texture - I love the glass bottles!  Having the flower heads pointing different ways works well - and the title is great.  Wish there weren''t quite such a different between the lighting on the left and right flowers - makes my eye feel the one on the left is too bright, the one on the right is too dark - and neither is really too anything except in contrast with eachother.', '2007-06-10 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1);
