(3763029, 526341, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good idea with good lighting and execution.</td>', 'Good idea with good lighting and execution.', '2007-06-10 13:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763033, 527324, 42013, '<td valign="top">I''m picky, but I''d like to see separation between the front and back goose. It bothers me how the bill of the front one overlaps the neck of the back goose.</td>', 'I''m picky, but I''d like to see separation between the front and back goose. It bothers me how the bill of the front one overlaps the neck of the back goose.', '2007-06-10 13:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763034, 524935, 7628, '<td valign="top">Intriguing combination. Without color the texture of the frog and the metal is SO alike!  The purple background works for me.</td>', 'Intriguing combination. Without color the texture of the frog and the metal is SO alike!  The purple background works for me.', '2007-06-10 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763036, 527418, 42013, '<td valign="top">You have obliterated the textures of the hands. Neat image perhaps?</td>', 'You have obliterated the textures of the hands. Neat image perhaps?', '2007-06-10 13:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763038, 527566, 7628, '<td valign="top">great texture, clever composition.</td>', 'great texture, clever composition.', '2007-06-10 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763040, 525069, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nicely found and photographed. Look at those ears!</td>', 'Nicely found and photographed. Look at those ears!', '2007-06-10 13:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763043, 527456, 42013, '<td valign="top">A little hard to make out at first as the RH umbrella is not easily identifiable. My eye travels directly to the sunburst.</td>', 'A little hard to make out at first as the RH umbrella is not easily identifiable. My eye travels directly to the sunburst.', '2007-06-10 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763044, 527452, 42013, '<td valign="top">Watch out!</td>', 'Watch out!', '2007-06-10 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763045, 527597, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and symetry.</td>', 'Nice composition and symetry.', '2007-06-10 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763046, 527514, 7628, '<td valign="top">Luminous!  The blue in the drops really glows in the context of the rusty colored backgroud - a result of the complimentary colors?  The smooth texture is truly inviting.</td>', 'Luminous!  The blue in the drops really glows in the context of the rusty colored backgroud - a result of the complimentary colors?  The smooth texture is truly inviting.', '2007-06-10 13:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763047, 526984, 42013, '<td valign="top">good focus and lighting. Greens look a little overcooked in the center of the bloom.</td>', 'good focus and lighting. Greens look a little overcooked in the center of the bloom.', '2007-06-10 13:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763049, 524943, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and you did a good job of captureing the movement.</td>', 'I like the idea and you did a good job of captureing the movement.', '2007-06-10 13:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763051, 527676, 7628, '<td valign="top">You got a nice expression out the birds and a sense of movement and anticipation.  Good focus, nice color.  Wish the bird weren''t cropped so close on the right.</td>', 'You got a nice expression out the birds and a sense of movement and anticipation.  Good focus, nice color.  Wish the bird weren''t cropped so close on the right.', '2007-06-10 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763054, 526962, 42013, '<td valign="top">I''ve commented on 73 so far and yours is the best of the bunch. Good connection to the viewer. Good luck!</td>', 'I''ve commented on 73 so far and yours is the best of the bunch. Good connection to the viewer. Good luck!', '2007-06-10 13:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763058, 527261, 7628, '<td valign="top">Creative, Felliniesque!  Lighting could be better - I am disratcted by the gradient on the wall - it is a bit too dark on the right.</td>', 'Creative, Felliniesque!  Lighting could be better - I am disratcted by the gradient on the wall - it is a bit too dark on the right.', '2007-06-10 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763059, 527641, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh.  The abstract of the water is the perfect environment for the swans to float in.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh.  The abstract of the water is the perfect environment for the swans to float in.', '2007-06-10 13:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763065, 527472, 7628, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the lenses make the shot - good attention to detail.  I think I would have liked an even tighter compostion of the cameras and leave out the "cannon digital" straps.</td>', 'The reflections in the lenses make the shot - good attention to detail.  I think I would have liked an even tighter compostion of the cameras and leave out the "cannon digital" straps.', '2007-06-10 13:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763070, 524988, 7628, '<td valign="top">Elegant lighting and color.  I lije the pun in the title, but the subject matter doesn''t really hold me.</td>', 'Elegant lighting and color.  I lije the pun in the title, but the subject matter doesn''t really hold me.', '2007-06-10 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763077, 527083, 7628, '<td valign="top">A fine juxtiposition.  I would crop a little more at top.  I don''t like the white and black lines inside the frame - they get confused with the lines of the camera.  Maybe leave a bit more room at the bottom and the left - space for what the cameras are "seeing?"</td>', 'A fine juxtiposition.  I would crop a little more at top.  I don''t like the white and black lines inside the frame - they get confused with the lines of the camera.  Maybe leave a bit more room at the bottom and the left - space for what the cameras are "seeing?"', '2007-06-10 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763086, 527222, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your use of depth to show the double.  The vignetting is romantic with the green field background - but the dark muzzle of the horse gets lost in it at the bottom.</td>', 'I like your use of depth to show the double.  The vignetting is romantic with the green field background - but the dark muzzle of the horse gets lost in it at the bottom.', '2007-06-10 13:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763090, 527111, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cute candid.  Nice range of grays.  A bit grainy for me - I''d like to see the women better.</td>', 'Cute candid.  Nice range of grays.  A bit grainy for me - I''d like to see the women better.', '2007-06-10 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763094, 527655, 16230, '<td valign="top">Hey, that''s a cool looking... uhh... plant. :)</td>', 'Hey, that''s a cool looking... uhh... plant. :)', '2007-06-10 13:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763101, 526115, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry.</td>', 'Nice symmetry.', '2007-06-10 13:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763115, 527334, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of food/drink, super shallow, dof shots but here I think you''ve diminished the power of the glass and the wine. This I would say is all about the rim of the glass and not much more, where a little of the glass itself and perhaps some of the wine would have been far more interesting.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of food/drink, super shallow, dof shots but here I think you''ve diminished the power of the glass and the wine. This I would say is all about the rim of the glass and not much more, where a little of the glass itself and perhaps some of the wine would have been far more interesting.', '2007-06-10 13:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763118, 526863, 30982, '<td valign="top">To do eggs and make ''em work here, you have to have dead-perfect techicals.  The eggs are a bit soft (shoulda used hardboiled - ha ha ha) and the light a bit flat, though I really like the shadows.  I also like that the eggs are two different kinds, too.  A meeting of the minds - it''s what''s inside, not the color of the shell.</td>', 'To do eggs and make ''em work here, you have to have dead-perfect techicals.  The eggs are a bit soft (shoulda used hardboiled - ha ha ha) and the light a bit flat, though I really like the shadows.  I also like that the eggs are two different kinds, too.  A meeting of the minds - it''s what''s inside, not the color of the shell.', '2007-06-10 13:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763121, 527261, 32767, '<td valign="top">Guess who?<br/> <br/>Nice concept. Not too keen on the shadows as they seem to diminish the contrast.</td>', 'Guess who? Nice concept. Not too keen on the shadows as they seem to diminish the contrast.', '2007-06-10 13:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763123, 527692, 30982, '<td valign="top">If you want to "wow" DPC voters, turn these at a slight angle so they''re not dead-on into the viewer (adds a bit of depth) and use a somewhat uniformish background in a basic color - like white.  I do like the double double take!</td>', 'If you want to "wow" DPC voters, turn these at a slight angle so they''re not dead-on into the viewer (adds a bit of depth) and use a somewhat uniformish background in a basic color - like white.  I do like the double double take!', '2007-06-10 13:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763126, 527519, 30982, '<td valign="top">While there are indeed two rocks exposed, the true double take would probably be the beautiful reflections.  Not sure if that was your intent or not.</td>', 'While there are indeed two rocks exposed, the true double take would probably be the beautiful reflections.  Not sure if that was your intent or not.', '2007-06-10 13:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763129, 527199, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Surely there is an amusing story behind this.  I saw another shot from the take in another challenge.  Traditional Icelandic Umbrella Fighting?  Some modern take on Glíma? Or maybe someone got married and things got a bit rough at the photo-shoot up at Árbaer? I like the composition with the house to the left, and the fun size difference between the men.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the men, though the flash helps them stand out on this gray day.  The sky in a bit purple for me.</td>', 'Funny.  Surely there is an amusing story behind this.  I saw another shot from the take in another challenge.  Traditional Icelandic Umbrella Fighting?  Some modern take on Glíma? Or maybe someone got married and things got a bit rough at the photo-shoot up at Árbaer? I like the composition with the house to the left, and the fun size difference between the men.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the men, though the flash helps them stand out on this gray day.  The sky in a bit purple for me.', '2007-06-10 13:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763131, 526759, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably not a very exciting photograph to the average viewer, but the company of Miller and Long would probably love a copy!</td>', 'Probably not a very exciting photograph to the average viewer, but the company of Miller and Long would probably love a copy!', '2007-06-10 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763134, 527120, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, I see the bright yellow cab and the poor dull grey sedan who''s probably insanely jealous yet conceals that jealousy by gossiping with the darker car behind about "the audacity of that thing to sit on our street!"</td>', 'To me, I see the bright yellow cab and the poor dull grey sedan who''s probably insanely jealous yet conceals that jealousy by gossiping with the darker car behind about "the audacity of that thing to sit on our street!"', '2007-06-10 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763141, 526787, 79648, '<td valign="top">Great use of color against the B&amp;W background.</td>', 'Great use of color against the B&W background.', '2007-06-10 13:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763156, 527560, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry right down to the reflections, but there seems to be warp to the neck of the bottle on the right - not sure if this is the angle or not.  Harsh reflections (next to impossible to avoid on wine bottles, I''ve found) generally are not liked well here.</td>', 'Good symmetry right down to the reflections, but there seems to be warp to the neck of the bottle on the right - not sure if this is the angle or not.  Harsh reflections (next to impossible to avoid on wine bottles, I''ve found) generally are not liked well here.', '2007-06-10 13:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763158, 526706, 30982, '<td valign="top">Rather title dependent and probably funny if you''re a guy.  :-)</td>', 'Rather title dependent and probably funny if you''re a guy.  :-)', '2007-06-10 13:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763160, 527474, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good potential!  Love the single blue eye on the dog.  Might have worked better with more of the dog in the picture.</td>', 'Very good potential!  Love the single blue eye on the dog.  Might have worked better with more of the dog in the picture.', '2007-06-10 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763167, 527652, 30982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing and well thought out.  I''m not a huge fan of the processing but it does suit this well.</td>', 'Intriguing and well thought out.  I''m not a huge fan of the processing but it does suit this well.', '2007-06-10 13:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763170, 524464, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite put my finger on it as to why, but the apples don''t look quite real to me.</td>', 'I can''t quite put my finger on it as to why, but the apples don''t look quite real to me.', '2007-06-10 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763174, 527683, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good shot for the challenge.  There seems to be a bit of banding in the color at the top - possibly due to increasing saturation?</td>', 'A good shot for the challenge.  There seems to be a bit of banding in the color at the top - possibly due to increasing saturation?', '2007-06-10 13:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763289, 527168, 70888, '<td valign="top">great capture,Ben comes to mind(hehe)...bumping up to 8</td>', 'great capture,Ben comes to mind(hehe)...bumping up to 8', '2007-06-10 14:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763347, 527590, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute, i like your style, the way your mind works.</td>', 'cute, i like your style, the way your mind works.', '2007-06-10 14:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763356, 526595, 16241, '<td valign="top">haha cute, i thought of doing this with oranges.</td>', 'haha cute, i thought of doing this with oranges.', '2007-06-10 14:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763647, 525288, 65234, '<td valign="top">Allium?  Pretty purples.  DOF seems a little extreme with the color difference making them stand out so well, anyway.</td>', 'Allium?  Pretty purples.  DOF seems a little extreme with the color difference making them stand out so well, anyway.', '2007-06-10 17:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763655, 526551, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you have the people there for perspective on the size of those doors.  They look quite intricate and I think I would enjoy seeing them in person.  The soft light from the lantern is nice, too.  It feels a bit like the horizon is tilted to the left and the crop is tighter on the left than the right; I know it''s tough with a subject this big to get it "straight" and centered compositions invite scrutiny of the parallel lines and distances that make small differences from one side to another more obvious.</td>', 'I''m glad you have the people there for perspective on the size of those doors.  They look quite intricate and I think I would enjoy seeing them in person.  The soft light from the lantern is nice, too.  It feels a bit like the horizon is tilted to the left and the crop is tighter on the left than the right; I know it''s tough with a subject this big to get it "straight" and centered compositions invite scrutiny of the parallel lines and distances that make small differences from one side to another more obvious.', '2007-06-10 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763662, 526817, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute deer and nice positioning in relation to one another and the camera.  Since the ears are cropped off you probably could have cropped much tighter on the left, too.</td>', 'Cute deer and nice positioning in relation to one another and the camera.  Since the ears are cropped off you probably could have cropped much tighter on the left, too.', '2007-06-10 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763669, 527095, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty nice looking backgammon set.  The reflections are a little fuzzywhich is disconcerting to look at for very long.</td>', 'That''s a pretty nice looking backgammon set.  The reflections are a little fuzzywhich is disconcerting to look at for very long.', '2007-06-10 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763678, 526883, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean, simple arrangement of shapes.   I keep looking at it with my head tilted to the left; I think I would like it even better oriented 90 degrees right, even though it''s a reflection pic.  Looks more like clasped hands that way, which I find appealing.</td>', 'Nice, clean, simple arrangement of shapes.   I keep looking at it with my head tilted to the left; I think I would like it even better oriented 90 degrees right, even though it''s a reflection pic.  Looks more like clasped hands that way, which I find appealing.', '2007-06-10 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763701, 527629, 65234, '<td valign="top">The crystals are a nice idea and background is nondistracting.  DOF is a good way to differentiate the crystals.  The reflection on the foreground crystal of what appears to be a window showing sky and trees distracts from seeing the similarities in them; perhaps some directed light on the foreground crystal would highlight the facets more like the background crystal.  I might also experiment with positioning so the foreground crystal doesn''t partially obscure the background one.</td>', 'The crystals are a nice idea and background is nondistracting.  DOF is a good way to differentiate the crystals.  The reflection on the foreground crystal of what appears to be a window showing sky and trees distracts from seeing the similarities in them; perhaps some directed light on the foreground crystal would highlight the facets more like the background crystal.  I might also experiment with positioning so the foreground crystal doesn''t partially obscure the background one.', '2007-06-10 17:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763703, 526746, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute composition!  Color on the yellow one looks particularly oversaturated.</td>', 'Cute composition!  Color on the yellow one looks particularly oversaturated.', '2007-06-10 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763705, 527482, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute idea; not sure I like the processing.</td>', 'Cute idea; not sure I like the processing.', '2007-06-10 17:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763718, 527360, 65234, '<td valign="top">The picture is sharp and the tonal range and exposure is very nice.  I am going to assume from the title that the subjects are mother and daughter-in-law.  They do have dark tops and somewhat similar expressions, but the sunglasses on just the one subject detract from further comparison, as does the difference in hair color.</td>', 'The picture is sharp and the tonal range and exposure is very nice.  I am going to assume from the title that the subjects are mother and daughter-in-law.  They do have dark tops and somewhat similar expressions, but the sunglasses on just the one subject detract from further comparison, as does the difference in hair color.', '2007-06-10 17:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763729, 526269, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is a really silly composition; I like it!  The different positions of the caterpillars make this much more interesting than if they had been parallel.</td>', 'This is a really silly composition; I like it!  The different positions of the caterpillars make this much more interesting than if they had been parallel.', '2007-06-10 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763731, 527627, 28070, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, Contrast, Color, Detail.  Maybe the inside of the right flower could use a spot of light to illuminate it a little more.</td>', 'Great lighting, Contrast, Color, Detail.  Maybe the inside of the right flower could use a spot of light to illuminate it a little more.', '2007-06-10 17:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763733, 527472, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting; I especially like the reflections in the lenses.</td>', 'Very nice lighting; I especially like the reflections in the lenses.', '2007-06-10 17:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763735, 526636, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Lighting is a little too bright for me, but I love the composition :-)</td>', 'LOL!  Lighting is a little too bright for me, but I love the composition :-)', '2007-06-10 17:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763737, 527154, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but the processing doesn''t add anything to it for me.</td>', 'Cute picture but the processing doesn''t add anything to it for me.', '2007-06-10 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763738, 527689, 28070, '<td valign="top">Double puppies.  Cute, I think they are too close to the top edge of the photo.  A little more space in there.  The green color is excellent.  The fur on the back and the top of the head is washed out losing detail.</td>', 'Double puppies.  Cute, I think they are too close to the top edge of the photo.  A little more space in there.  The green color is excellent.  The fur on the back and the top of the head is washed out losing detail.', '2007-06-10 17:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763741, 527620, 65234, '<td valign="top">They don''t look all that fuzzy.  Lighting is nice and soft; I think I would have preferred a less busy plate to display them on.</td>', 'They don''t look all that fuzzy.  Lighting is nice and soft; I think I would have preferred a less busy plate to display them on.', '2007-06-10 17:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763747, 525890, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting, kind of abstract.  I rather like the blue.</td>', 'Interesting, kind of abstract.  I rather like the blue.', '2007-06-10 17:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763754, 527288, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute and nice use of selective desat.  I like how they are so close together; they obviously get along well.  Did you have to move their hair out of their eyes so we could see them?</td>', 'Very cute and nice use of selective desat.  I like how they are so close together; they obviously get along well.  Did you have to move their hair out of their eyes so we could see them?', '2007-06-10 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763756, 527326, 28070, '<td valign="top">Twins in striped stockings.  Cute girls.  Interesting pose on the left side, which makes it sort of awkward.  Nice background.</td>', 'Twins in striped stockings.  Cute girls.  Interesting pose on the left side, which makes it sort of awkward.  Nice background.', '2007-06-10 17:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763762, 527175, 65234, '<td valign="top">Double doubles!  Colors look a little muted on my screen and I wish there were catchlights in the swan''s eyes.  Guess that overhanging eyebrowish bit makes it tough to get a catchlight.</td>', 'Double doubles!  Colors look a little muted on my screen and I wish there were catchlights in the swan''s eyes.  Guess that overhanging eyebrowish bit makes it tough to get a catchlight.', '2007-06-10 17:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763767, 527298, 65234, '<td valign="top">Certainly a difference perspective; feels a little voyeuristic.</td>', 'Certainly a difference perspective; feels a little voyeuristic.', '2007-06-10 17:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763769, 526594, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice and unique, besides.  Just enough of the flag to show that it matches the tattoo.</td>', 'Nice and unique, besides.  Just enough of the flag to show that it matches the tattoo.', '2007-06-10 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763771, 526356, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pepper shot.  Lighting, in particular, is very good.</td>', 'Nice pepper shot.  Lighting, in particular, is very good.', '2007-06-10 17:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763780, 526864, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea.  I wish they were either both aligned with the red fence or each was clearly in front of each color fence.  The son being halfway between fence colors is somewhat distracting to me.</td>', 'Very cute idea.  I wish they were either both aligned with the red fence or each was clearly in front of each color fence.  The son being halfway between fence colors is somewhat distracting to me.', '2007-06-10 17:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763784, 526182, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  Looks a little noisy, especially in the upper petals.</td>', 'Pretty.  Looks a little noisy, especially in the upper petals.', '2007-06-10 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763792, 523393, 78577, '<td valign="top">one of my few 10s! i love it</td>', 'one of my few 10s! i love it', '2007-06-10 18:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763793, 527638, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done composition to emphasize the similarities between them.  It helps that they have identical eye makeup.</td>', 'Very nicely done composition to emphasize the similarities between them.  It helps that they have identical eye makeup.', '2007-06-10 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763796, 527693, 28070, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Cool containers.  Little reflections on each one.  Focus might be a little off or detail.  A small frame might make this better.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Cool containers.  Little reflections on each one.  Focus might be a little off or detail.  A small frame might make this better.', '2007-06-10 18:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763799, 523860, 65234, '<td valign="top">Spider; ewww.  Actually, it looks like he''s missing some legs on his right side?!  I *almost* feel sorry for him.</td>', 'Spider; ewww.  Actually, it looks like he''s missing some legs on his right side?!  I *almost* feel sorry for him.', '2007-06-10 18:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763803, 527638, 28070, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Nice idea.  It is very strange if I stare at this for to long, my mind tries to make one face out of the two.</td>', 'Cool.  Nice idea.  It is very strange if I stare at this for to long, my mind tries to make one face out of the two.', '2007-06-10 18:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763809, 527560, 28070, '<td valign="top">It is kind of dull for me.  Lined up right next to each other facing the same way.  Try an angle shot with more of an offset rule of thirds sort of thing.  Color would be nice too for this one.</td>', 'It is kind of dull for me.  Lined up right next to each other facing the same way.  Try an angle shot with more of an offset rule of thirds sort of thing.  Color would be nice too for this one.', '2007-06-10 18:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763812, 525645, 79090, '<td valign="top">the processing, I think, does not add to the photo, but rather detracts...the colors are dull as well</td>', 'the processing, I think, does not add to the photo, but rather detracts...the colors are dull as well', '2007-06-10 18:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763814, 527388, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; that''s not something most people ever get to see.  Very cool.</td>', 'Wow; that''s not something most people ever get to see.  Very cool.', '2007-06-10 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763817, 527619, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Love the rim reflections in the water as well.  You shoulda given the little car a puddle of it''s own so you could ger reflections from there too.</td>', 'Cute!  Love the rim reflections in the water as well.  You shoulda given the little car a puddle of it''s own so you could ger reflections from there too.', '2007-06-10 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
