(3763834, 525406, 28070, '<td valign="top">Nice double bunnies.  Color seems to be a bit on the yellow side.  Use the eyedropper tool in levels to set the white point or desaturate the yellow with hue/saturation.  Background is nice though a few wrinkles in the back.  Try ironing or steaming the cloth or getting it wet then dry it out while you have it stretched out and flat.<br/> <br/>I wonder what is the going rate these days for a bunny model?  Is it still two carrots and a handful of grass? lol.</td>', 'Nice double bunnies.  Color seems to be a bit on the yellow side.  Use the eyedropper tool in levels to set the white point or desaturate the yellow with hue/saturation.  Background is nice though a few wrinkles in the back.  Try ironing or steaming the cloth or getting it wet then dry it out while you have it stretched out and flat. I wonder what is the going rate these days for a bunny model?  Is it still two carrots and a handful of grass? lol.', '2007-06-10 18:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763836, 524988, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lovely set up and lighting.  The color seems like too much in the bottom glass but must all be due to reflections.</td>', 'Lovely set up and lighting.  The color seems like too much in the bottom glass but must all be due to reflections.', '2007-06-10 18:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763840, 525645, 67697, '<td valign="top">Be interesting to see if you got a lot of comments on the processing.  I like the dabbed painted effect.</td>', 'Be interesting to see if you got a lot of comments on the processing.  I like the dabbed painted effect.', '2007-06-10 18:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763849, 526595, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the guys will dig this but to me this isn''t my taste I guess.  Why did you put her hair up?  It looks like she has fun hair which is now hidden by the white piece that blends in with the background.</td>', 'I''m sure the guys will dig this but to me this isn''t my taste I guess.  Why did you put her hair up?  It looks like she has fun hair which is now hidden by the white piece that blends in with the background.', '2007-06-10 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763853, 527655, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty arrangement with nice lighting.  What kind of flowers are these?</td>', 'Very pretty arrangement with nice lighting.  What kind of flowers are these?', '2007-06-10 18:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763854, 527085, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot; colors are not overdone and DOF is perfect to show off these two beauties.</td>', 'I like this one a lot; colors are not overdone and DOF is perfect to show off these two beauties.', '2007-06-10 18:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763856, 527334, 28070, '<td valign="top">Well I can figure out it is two glasses.  Nice morphing into the frame.  But overall the blur is distracting, not enough sharp detail in any place.  Very soft.  Interesting still, I examined it for a while.</td>', 'Well I can figure out it is two glasses.  Nice morphing into the frame.  But overall the blur is distracting, not enough sharp detail in any place.  Very soft.  Interesting still, I examined it for a while.', '2007-06-10 18:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763858, 525954, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the changes in sky colors.  A very different artsy pic.</td>', 'I like the changes in sky colors.  A very different artsy pic.', '2007-06-10 18:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763860, 526584, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the faces - looks like they were talking to you.</td>', 'Love the faces - looks like they were talking to you.', '2007-06-10 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
