(3763862, 525842, 65234, '<td valign="top">Intriguing juxtaposition.  This one invites the viewer to look and think, and I really like the title.  Nice work.</td>', 'Intriguing juxtaposition.  This one invites the viewer to look and think, and I really like the title.  Nice work.', '2007-06-10 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
