(3763875, 525895, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG, they are so cute!!!  Love seeing them sticking so close together in the face of the camera, like the background kid is hiding behind his brother.</td>', 'OMG, they are so cute!!!  Love seeing them sticking so close together in the face of the camera, like the background kid is hiding behind his brother.', '2007-06-10 18:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763876, 527226, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes on both.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes on both.', '2007-06-10 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763878, 526513, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and lighting on the buildings.</td>', 'Lovely colors and lighting on the buildings.', '2007-06-10 18:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763879, 526978, 7628, '<td valign="top">Jellyfish are a lovely subject.  I like the different colors - UV light?  However the focus is not very sharp, and the composition -very horizontal- does nothing for these free floating animals - perhaps rotate and crop so they are floating more diagonal or even a 90 degree rotate to vertical might give more of a sense of weightlessness.</td>', 'Jellyfish are a lovely subject.  I like the different colors - UV light?  However the focus is not very sharp, and the composition -very horizontal- does nothing for these free floating animals - perhaps rotate and crop so they are floating more diagonal or even a 90 degree rotate to vertical might give more of a sense of weightlessness.', '2007-06-10 18:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763881, 523005, 79090, '<td valign="top">saturation is odd...the legs look like fake legs...(the rest of the image is clear however)</td>', 'saturation is odd...the legs look like fake legs...(the rest of the image is clear however)', '2007-06-10 18:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763882, 526825, 28070, '<td valign="top">Looks like they are in a "Cover-Kitty" (<i>Cover-Girl</i>) ad with there hair blowing back.  <br/>Nice vertical-offset-to-the-left-a-little,-horizontal-in-the-middle composition.</td>', 'Looks like they are in a "Cover-Kitty" (Cover-Girl) ad with there hair blowing back.  Nice vertical-offset-to-the-left-a-little,-horizontal-in-the-middle composition.', '2007-06-10 18:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763884, 527348, 67697, '<td valign="top">Eerie and dramatic.  I like the sky and the dark mid-background (or mid-foreground, whatever it''s called)</td>', 'Eerie and dramatic.  I like the sky and the dark mid-background (or mid-foreground, whatever it''s called)', '2007-06-10 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763888, 526140, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  Enough of them peeking out to see their lovely color, and it''s cute to see their little bug eyes peeking at you.  Maybe could have used a touch more DOF so the top bug was completely in focus.</td>', 'What a great shot!  Enough of them peeking out to see their lovely color, and it''s cute to see their little bug eyes peeking at you.  Maybe could have used a touch more DOF so the top bug was completely in focus.', '2007-06-10 18:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763891, 525657, 65234, '<td valign="top">Certainly not something I see every day ... OK, not ever.  Wow.  Nice lighting and detail, although a wee bit gross ;-)</td>', 'Certainly not something I see every day ... OK, not ever.  Wow.  Nice lighting and detail, although a wee bit gross ;-)', '2007-06-10 18:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763893, 527418, 28070, '<td valign="top">Interesting, Nice detail on the thumbs.  Great light and composition.</td>', 'Interesting, Nice detail on the thumbs.  Great light and composition.', '2007-06-10 18:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763894, 526102, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, good composition, it''s pairs (or should I say pears?) whether horizontal or vertical in the reflection.  Nice and sharp, maybe unrealistically, and good black background.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, good composition, it''s pairs (or should I say pears?) whether horizontal or vertical in the reflection.  Nice and sharp, maybe unrealistically, and good black background.', '2007-06-10 18:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763896, 526412, 7628, '<td valign="top">While the stand-out subject seems to be the white pawn, the focus is not really on it, but the two rooks behind.  The composition is cluttered - perhaps if it were just the king and queen - is that your double take? - and the pawn.  Or is the double take the two pawns, clear and white? Or maybe you meant the two rooks to be the subject - but they are pushed so far to the back.  I guess my main advice is you need to use some photographic tool - focus, light, composition - to help the viewer understand better what is going on in the photo.</td>', 'While the stand-out subject seems to be the white pawn, the focus is not really on it, but the two rooks behind.  The composition is cluttered - perhaps if it were just the king and queen - is that your double take? - and the pawn.  Or is the double take the two pawns, clear and white? Or maybe you meant the two rooks to be the subject - but they are pushed so far to the back.  I guess my main advice is you need to use some photographic tool - focus, light, composition - to help the viewer understand better what is going on in the photo.', '2007-06-10 18:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763898, 526863, 76430, '<td valign="top">The If you''re trying to be symmetrical the left one is a bit higher and out of focus.  I like the different colored eggs.  Interesting multiple shadows.</td>', 'The If you''re trying to be symmetrical the left one is a bit higher and out of focus.  I like the different colored eggs.  Interesting multiple shadows.', '2007-06-10 18:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763905, 526627, 7628, '<td valign="top">It looks like this was really fun to shoot.  I like the idea of the two subjects in the abstract swirl of light, but I wish the subjects were not blurred - better to freeze the action with a flash after you''ve done the light spinning.  The light on the subject to the right has blown out the details of of her face.</td>', 'It looks like this was really fun to shoot.  I like the idea of the two subjects in the abstract swirl of light, but I wish the subjects were not blurred - better to freeze the action with a flash after you''ve done the light spinning.  The light on the subject to the right has blown out the details of of her face.', '2007-06-10 18:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763909, 527638, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the 50% face crop and almost looking like a head against a mirror except for the different color hair, etc.</td>', 'I like the 50% face crop and almost looking like a head against a mirror except for the different color hair, etc.', '2007-06-10 18:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763913, 526802, 65234, '<td valign="top">With their little slime trails clearly showing and everything.  Aww.  Or eww.  I can''t decide!</td>', 'With their little slime trails clearly showing and everything.  Aww.  Or eww.  I can''t decide!', '2007-06-10 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763917, 527322, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea to reflect the glass in a curved surface - so it is the same, but not the same all at once.  Aside from that the photo is not very interesting.  No interesting colors, no dynamic range, the lighting is pretty bland. Perhaps a more contrasting background, or more of a gradient of light, or a more interesting subject to have reflected.</td>', 'Interesting idea to reflect the glass in a curved surface - so it is the same, but not the same all at once.  Aside from that the photo is not very interesting.  No interesting colors, no dynamic range, the lighting is pretty bland. Perhaps a more contrasting background, or more of a gradient of light, or a more interesting subject to have reflected.', '2007-06-10 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763920, 525406, 65234, '<td valign="top">They are ridiculously adorable!  Lighting is nice, especially for the bunny on the right.  Would love to see a catchlight in the left one''s eye, too, and the background not so wrinkled.  Hope they got a treat for posing so sweetly!</td>', 'They are ridiculously adorable!  Lighting is nice, especially for the bunny on the right.  Would love to see a catchlight in the left one''s eye, too, and the background not so wrinkled.  Hope they got a treat for posing so sweetly!', '2007-06-10 18:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763921, 526746, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness on this macro.  I like how the orange one is on the yellow plant and vice versa.</td>', 'Nice sharpness on this macro.  I like how the orange one is on the yellow plant and vice versa.', '2007-06-10 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763923, 525067, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see the differences inside the pepper slices - another play on same but different.  The focus is not entirely sharp and the lighting is rather harsh with distracting shadows.  If your background were very bright white or entirely dark it would make the peppers stand out better.</td>', 'Interesting to see the differences inside the pepper slices - another play on same but different.  The focus is not entirely sharp and the lighting is rather harsh with distracting shadows.  If your background were very bright white or entirely dark it would make the peppers stand out better.', '2007-06-10 18:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763933, 527213, 18080, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!<br/>Works really well<br/>10<br/>good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'LOVE IT!Works really well10good luck Kev', '2007-06-10 18:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763934, 522891, 76430, '<td valign="top">Old time look with the B&amp;W and vignette.  Either it''s an illusion or the ocean is a bit slanted.  The boat in the background is a distraction.</td>', 'Old time look with the B&W and vignette.  Either it''s an illusion or the ocean is a bit slanted.  The boat in the background is a distraction.', '2007-06-10 18:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763935, 527324, 18080, '<td valign="top">I really like the shallow depth of field that you have used in this shot.<br/>Fits the challenge perfectly<br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'I really like the shallow depth of field that you have used in this shot.Fits the challenge perfectlyGood luck Kev', '2007-06-10 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763941, 527100, 7628, '<td valign="top">Good subject - two lanes, two balls.  But one and a half people, and odd assortment of pins... There is a bit much going on here so it doesn''t really focus on the "double" idea to me.  Also nothing is really in focus, and the top third of the photo is a boring wall.  I shot that closed in more on the action, with a dynamic composition - vertical or diagonal - might convey bowling better. I do light the blue cast - it reminds me of the florescent lighting at a bowling alley.</td>', 'Good subject - two lanes, two balls.  But one and a half people, and odd assortment of pins... There is a bit much going on here so it doesn''t really focus on the "double" idea to me.  Also nothing is really in focus, and the top third of the photo is a boring wall.  I shot that closed in more on the action, with a dynamic composition - vertical or diagonal - might convey bowling better. I do light the blue cast - it reminds me of the florescent lighting at a bowling alley.', '2007-06-10 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763944, 526191, 28070, '<td valign="top">I can see you dodged the head there and there is a blue smudge right above the male duck.  <br/> <br/>Try cloning the blue on another layer and then turning down the transparency of that layer to blend more.  Or turn down the transparency on the clone tool.<br/> <br/>On the head,  Zoom in all the way and trace out the part with the selection tool pressing space bar to move the image around so you can continue tracing.  Layer via copy and adjust the levels and whatever on this copy of the selection.  Doesn''t need to be perfect you can go back up close and erase from this layer if it overlaps anywhere.<br/> <br/>Nice capture while they are flying.</td>', 'I can see you dodged the head there and there is a blue smudge right above the male duck.   Try cloning the blue on another layer and then turning down the transparency of that layer to blend more.  Or turn down the transparency on the clone tool. On the head,  Zoom in all the way and trace out the part with the selection tool pressing space bar to move the image around so you can continue tracing.  Layer via copy and adjust the levels and whatever on this copy of the selection.  Doesn''t need to be perfect you can go back up close and erase from this layer if it overlaps anywhere. Nice capture while they are flying.', '2007-06-10 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763945, 525406, 76430, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp, and the background cloth has lots of wrinkles and waves in it.</td>', 'Not very sharp, and the background cloth has lots of wrinkles and waves in it.', '2007-06-10 18:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763948, 526806, 18080, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.<br/>BUT...<br/>Sometimes i like the bird and other times i don''t.<br/>Now this takes the score betwwen a 10 and a 9. So depending on what i think at roll over...<br/>But i like the dead space at the top and bottom. I love the lightness of the clouds and the colours are great.<br/>Best of luck, i hope this does well for you.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'I really like this shot.BUT...Sometimes i like the bird and other times i don''t.Now this takes the score betwwen a 10 and a 9. So depending on what i think at roll over...But i like the dead space at the top and bottom. I love the lightness of the clouds and the colours are great.Best of luck, i hope this does well for you. Kev', '2007-06-10 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763950, 527334, 18080, '<td valign="top">i really like this shot.<br/>9 from me<br/>the depth of field is amazing.<br/>Love it<br/>good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'i really like this shot.9 from methe depth of field is amazing.Love itgood luck Kev', '2007-06-10 18:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763951, 526624, 28070, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s funny........lol..........good shot.  Focus or sharpness is a little off.</td>', 'Wow, that''s funny........lol..........good shot.  Focus or sharpness is a little off.', '2007-06-10 18:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763952, 527413, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the fruit flying through the air.</td>', 'I like the effect of the fruit flying through the air.', '2007-06-10 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763956, 526288, 7628, '<td valign="top">Tow colors of rhododendrons - fine.  But your composition doesn''t really say double to me - your subject roams around the left and top edge of the frame, and is lost by all the leaves.  The viewer''s eyes wander about aimlessly, end up on the rocks at the bottom right.  crop tighter on the lush pink bloom in the foreground with the darker blooms behind, perhaps out of focus, but still this sort of composition would ask the viewer to contrast the two similar things.</td>', 'Tow colors of rhododendrons - fine.  But your composition doesn''t really say double to me - your subject roams around the left and top edge of the frame, and is lost by all the leaves.  The viewer''s eyes wander about aimlessly, end up on the rocks at the bottom right.  crop tighter on the lush pink bloom in the foreground with the darker blooms behind, perhaps out of focus, but still this sort of composition would ask the viewer to contrast the two similar things.', '2007-06-10 18:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763959, 527100, 76430, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the person on the right, especially with a similar pose, to make these two alleys look about the same.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the person on the right, especially with a similar pose, to make these two alleys look about the same.', '2007-06-10 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763964, 527234, 76430, '<td valign="top">It has poor focus on the yellow rose. The double take is barely visible.</td>', 'It has poor focus on the yellow rose. The double take is barely visible.', '2007-06-10 18:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763965, 527504, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is quite lovely - I like how you have painted the blooms with light so that they appear to hang in the darkness.  The doubling is very apparent.  The photo is a bit dark, and the color cast is a bit yellow.  I''d crop tighter to the flowers.</td>', 'This is quite lovely - I like how you have painted the blooms with light so that they appear to hang in the darkness.  The doubling is very apparent.  The photo is a bit dark, and the color cast is a bit yellow.  I''d crop tighter to the flowers.', '2007-06-10 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763969, 527482, 7628, '<td valign="top">The contrast here is very high - you''ve lost details in the black and in the white.  Perhaps it is what you intended, but I do not find it adds to the subject.</td>', 'The contrast here is very high - you''ve lost details in the black and in the white.  Perhaps it is what you intended, but I do not find it adds to the subject.', '2007-06-10 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763975, 526534, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I was thinking of doing something similar.</td>', 'Nice.  I was thinking of doing something similar.', '2007-06-10 18:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763979, 527001, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the habanero orange on the yellow with the green stem.  Nice color combination and composition.</td>', 'I like the habanero orange on the yellow with the green stem.  Nice color combination and composition.', '2007-06-10 18:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763982, 527632, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh and nearly mirror image.</td>', 'Nice bokeh and nearly mirror image.', '2007-06-10 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763984, 526126, 76430, '<td valign="top">This looks fake.  Is it heavily sharpened?  Nevertheless I like it otherwise.</td>', 'This looks fake.  Is it heavily sharpened?  Nevertheless I like it otherwise.', '2007-06-10 18:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
