(3764010, 527261, 78488, '<td valign="top">best pic ive seen so far.</td>', 'best pic ive seen so far.', '2007-06-10 18:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764011, 526864, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but with the angle it looks like they''re looking at a picket fence.  I think they''re looking at what''s above the dark band on top, a carnival ride?  I think a grass level angle would be better here if it didn''t get too busy in the background.</td>', 'Nice picture, but with the angle it looks like they''re looking at a picket fence.  I think they''re looking at what''s above the dark band on top, a carnival ride?  I think a grass level angle would be better here if it didn''t get too busy in the background.', '2007-06-10 18:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764016, 525489, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good catch.  Almost an hourglass figure.</td>', 'Good catch.  Almost an hourglass figure.', '2007-06-10 18:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764028, 527273, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  It would be nice to get a little more front view of the deer and some sunlight on them, but I know that''s hard to manage.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  It would be nice to get a little more front view of the deer and some sunlight on them, but I know that''s hard to manage.', '2007-06-10 19:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764031, 526825, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I like the fact that each is looking across the other, their positions mirror image, one is black and one is gray, the soft furry texture of their fur, and the bright white background.    The fold in the background, upper left, is distracting - you could dodge it out.  I wish the lighting was a little more interesting - this just feels bright and all over...</td>', 'Very cute!  I like the fact that each is looking across the other, their positions mirror image, one is black and one is gray, the soft furry texture of their fur, and the bright white background.    The fold in the background, upper left, is distracting - you could dodge it out.  I wish the lighting was a little more interesting - this just feels bright and all over...', '2007-06-10 19:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764034, 525069, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good placement of heads in thirds and consistent grass background.  bump.</td>', 'Good placement of heads in thirds and consistent grass background.  bump.', '2007-06-10 19:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764036, 526971, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh and capture of background flower in drops.  It''s been done a lot lately, but still nice.</td>', 'Good bokeh and capture of background flower in drops.  It''s been done a lot lately, but still nice.', '2007-06-10 19:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764047, 526102, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fascinating doubling!  New and old AND reflections to boot!  Nicely composed with curves leaning into each other.  Moody lighting works and the colors are great!</td>', 'Fascinating doubling!  New and old AND reflections to boot!  Nicely composed with curves leaning into each other.  Moody lighting works and the colors are great!', '2007-06-10 19:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764053, 526341, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun.  Well done - well lit and composed.</td>', 'Fun.  Well done - well lit and composed.', '2007-06-10 19:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764064, 527372, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a glorious sky!  And the golden light of the sun is nicely mirrored in the wine.  The wine glasses being the subject, I wish they stood out more.  Making them proportionally larger in the composition might work, or darken the water behind them a bit more.</td>', 'What a glorious sky!  And the golden light of the sun is nicely mirrored in the wine.  The wine glasses being the subject, I wish they stood out more.  Making them proportionally larger in the composition might work, or darken the water behind them a bit more.', '2007-06-10 19:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764069, 526704, 7628, '<td valign="top">Your choice of black and white helps emphasize the "two-ness" of the photographers.  The composition is nice with them on the thirds line, pointing their cameras out over the spectacular view.  But the picture becomes more about photography than about the two subjects.  Very pleasing photo, just not so much for this challenge.</td>', 'Your choice of black and white helps emphasize the "two-ness" of the photographers.  The composition is nice with them on the thirds line, pointing their cameras out over the spectacular view.  But the picture becomes more about photography than about the two subjects.  Very pleasing photo, just not so much for this challenge.', '2007-06-10 19:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764079, 526930, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, and nicely lit.  The green wrapper on the pot is distracting - a plain pit might have been better.  The veil is also less than lovely - a more gauzy material fanning out behind the "bride''s" head would be better.  I''m afraid this looks more like an old bandage or stocking.</td>', 'Fun idea, and nicely lit.  The green wrapper on the pot is distracting - a plain pit might have been better.  The veil is also less than lovely - a more gauzy material fanning out behind the "bride''s" head would be better.  I''m afraid this looks more like an old bandage or stocking.', '2007-06-10 19:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764086, 526865, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice choice to compose this so tight and centered- it forces the comparison and the doubling aspect.  I like the textural detail and the bits of rusty color.  But in the end, it is not such an engrossing subject.</td>', 'Nice choice to compose this so tight and centered- it forces the comparison and the doubling aspect.  I like the textural detail and the bits of rusty color.  But in the end, it is not such an engrossing subject.', '2007-06-10 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764172, 527336, 18080, '<td valign="top">Love it<br/>A big ten<br/>would love to see this top 3<br/>good luck<br/> <br/>kev</td>', 'Love itA big tenwould love to see this top 3good luck kev', '2007-06-10 19:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
