(3764866, 527641, 58452, '<td valign="top">Something about this one just catches my eye.  I want to keep looking at it.  That means a lot when I score an image.  The surface details in the water and the way the lines that transition out of the water into the darkness mirror reflections of the birds heads below them.  A very serene and peaceful scene.  Enough babbling, this should ribbon.</td>', 'Something about this one just catches my eye.  I want to keep looking at it.  That means a lot when I score an image.  The surface details in the water and the way the lines that transition out of the water into the darkness mirror reflections of the birds heads below them.  A very serene and peaceful scene.  Enough babbling, this should ribbon.', '2007-06-10 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764869, 526685, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool!</td>', 'Pretty cool!', '2007-06-10 23:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764874, 527514, 58452, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for bubbles and these two are great.  I love the surrounding glow effect on the background and the treatment of the surfaces is just beautiful.  It reminds me of something that Ursula or Dax would create.  I love it.  Definitely should ribbon.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for bubbles and these two are great.  I love the surrounding glow effect on the background and the treatment of the surfaces is just beautiful.  It reminds me of something that Ursula or Dax would create.  I love it.  Definitely should ribbon.', '2007-06-10 23:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764881, 524988, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful treatment of a often used prop.</td>', 'Beautiful treatment of a often used prop.', '2007-06-10 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764884, 526624, 58452, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Would have been cooler if the baby wrench had been much smaller.  That''s just a nit pick.  I bet it will top ten.</td>', 'Very creative.  Would have been cooler if the baby wrench had been much smaller.  That''s just a nit pick.  I bet it will top ten.', '2007-06-10 23:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
