(3764974, 527261, 60862, '<td valign="top">The most artistic shot I''ve seen yet.  Silverfoxx?  I just love the variations on theme here - how your body matches the chair''s shape, the circles over the chair match your head''s shape ... even the shadows are similar.</td>', 'The most artistic shot I''ve seen yet.  Silverfoxx?  I just love the variations on theme here - how your body matches the chair''s shape, the circles over the chair match your head''s shape ... even the shadows are similar.', '2007-06-10 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
