(3765106, 527077, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love that the dice in the air are what''s in focus.  That must have been hard to do.  Either you figured out some way to suspend them (wire straight back?) or you kept throwing the dice through the focal point and shot at high speed and got lucky.  I can''t imaging how many throws to get double deuces, hit the focal plane, be in the shot, and have double 4''s on the other side.</td>', 'I love that the dice in the air are what''s in focus.  That must have been hard to do.  Either you figured out some way to suspend them (wire straight back?) or you kept throwing the dice through the focal point and shot at high speed and got lucky.  I can''t imaging how many throws to get double deuces, hit the focal plane, be in the shot, and have double 4''s on the other side.', '2007-06-10 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
