(3767300, 527111, 26464, '<td valign="top">good work.<br/> <br/>ps - they were both talking to me. <br/>:-)<br/></td>', 'good work. ps - they were both talking to me. :-)', '2007-06-11 10:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767309, 526971, 35004, '<td valign="top">amazing picture. Something to aspire to.</td>', 'amazing picture. Something to aspire to.', '2007-06-11 10:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767324, 527590, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, yet more proof that I''ll never understand the average voter. My <i>immediate</i> reaction to this photo was: what a very clever interpretation to photograph a cartwheel and a ferris-wheel. It never even occurred to me that it might not meet the challenge. But judging by the ridiculously low score, lots of people must have thought so. Sigh...</td>', 'Wow, yet more proof that I''ll never understand the average voter. My immediate reaction to this photo was: what a very clever interpretation to photograph a cartwheel and a ferris-wheel. It never even occurred to me that it might not meet the challenge. But judging by the ridiculously low score, lots of people must have thought so. Sigh...', '2007-06-11 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767331, 527495, 51793, '<td valign="top">Alright... 39, congrants... You did much better than me.</td>', 'Alright... 39, congrants... You did much better than me.', '2007-06-11 10:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767338, 527590, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lisa I really liked this shot and got the idea of cartwheel and big wheel straight away.  Lovely image, idea and execution</td>', 'Lisa I really liked this shot and got the idea of cartwheel and big wheel straight away.  Lovely image, idea and execution', '2007-06-11 10:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767345, 527484, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ha welcome once again to the weird world of DPC Challenge voting where the mixture of some people loving the soft focus on the the eyes and others saying in needed to be improved probably caused you to either laugh or cry (or possibly both)<br/> <br/>Just thought this was a really interesting and well balanced take on the challenge</td>', 'Ha welcome once again to the weird world of DPC Challenge voting where the mixture of some people loving the soft focus on the the eyes and others saying in needed to be improved probably caused you to either laugh or cry (or possibly both) Just thought this was a really interesting and well balanced take on the challenge', '2007-06-11 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767354, 525563, 68035, '<td valign="top">Grrrrrrrrrrrrrr  I should have KNOWN only one person lurks around back alleys taking lovely b&amp;w abstracts.  I thought this was a really intriguing image and desreved to finish higher than it did</td>', 'Grrrrrrrrrrrrrr  I should have KNOWN only one person lurks around back alleys taking lovely b&w abstracts.  I thought this was a really intriguing image and desreved to finish higher than it did', '2007-06-11 10:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
