(3767370, 527075, 64670, '<td valign="top">Hey strong image buddy, well done - hope you''re proud - I love the grass!<br/> <br/>Looks like most didn''t get the double take, but at the end of the day it''s more important that YOU LOVE your image - SMILE!</td>', 'Hey strong image buddy, well done - hope you''re proud - I love the grass! Looks like most didn''t get the double take, but at the end of the day it''s more important that YOU LOVE your image - SMILE!', '2007-06-11 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767374, 526133, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter this had been an image that I had liked in the challenge but just lacked the pop to make it a stop you in your tracks shot.  Know that I know that you didnt have your ''proper'' kit with you I understand why<br/> <br/>Still made for a cool ''different'' image in the challenge though<br/> <br/></td>', 'Peter this had been an image that I had liked in the challenge but just lacked the pop to make it a stop you in your tracks shot.  Know that I know that you didnt have your ''proper'' kit with you I understand why Still made for a cool ''different'' image in the challenge though ', '2007-06-11 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767375, 526971, 74037, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2007-06-11 10:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767440, 526971, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clarity - excellent.....<br/>Idea - Well excuted.....<br/>Colors - Awesome.....<br/>"WOW" factor - Definately.....<br/>Last word - Perfection.....<br/></td>', 'Clarity - excellent.....Idea - Well excuted.....Colors - Awesome....."WOW" factor - Definately.....Last word - Perfection.....', '2007-06-11 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767441, 525821, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo! Great photo - love the tight composition - and great finish! I think you could have cropped even a little more from the right, but works very well as is, too.</td>', 'Woo hoo! Great photo - love the tight composition - and great finish! I think you could have cropped even a little more from the right, but works very well as is, too.', '2007-06-11 10:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767448, 526268, 66597, '<td valign="top">An example of a very artistic photo that gets punished on DPC. I always look forward to seeing your work, and this is no exception. I would actually prefer it without the reaper-type figure in the back, though. I think with just the woman as a subject it would be a gallery-quality photo. (Realize it wouldn''t have worked for the challenge that way, but my .02 for your portfolio.)</td>', 'An example of a very artistic photo that gets punished on DPC. I always look forward to seeing your work, and this is no exception. I would actually prefer it without the reaper-type figure in the back, though. I think with just the woman as a subject it would be a gallery-quality photo. (Realize it wouldn''t have worked for the challenge that way, but my .02 for your portfolio.)', '2007-06-11 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767455, 527590, 50641, '<td valign="top">Excellent, wish I''d gotten to this in voting.  Like your duotones.  Clearly your choice was deliberate - but I wonder about getting the ferris wheel in the other orientation to drive home the wheel aspect.  When it looks like a tower like this, I almost want to see a handstand instead.  Wonderful interpretation though!</td>', 'Excellent, wish I''d gotten to this in voting.  Like your duotones.  Clearly your choice was deliberate - but I wonder about getting the ferris wheel in the other orientation to drive home the wheel aspect.  When it looks like a tower like this, I almost want to see a handstand instead.  Wonderful interpretation though!', '2007-06-11 10:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767462, 527456, 66597, '<td valign="top">I can''t say this necessarily fits the challenge too well, but as a photo in its own merit it is very interesting. (I tend to like photos that push the challenge envelope and probably would have given you a 7 if I''d voted this.) You wouldn''t be Don Giovanni, LOL, if you didn''t make the viewers think for a moment.</td>', 'I can''t say this necessarily fits the challenge too well, but as a photo in its own merit it is very interesting. (I tend to like photos that push the challenge envelope and probably would have given you a 7 if I''d voted this.) You wouldn''t be Don Giovanni, LOL, if you didn''t make the viewers think for a moment.', '2007-06-11 10:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767467, 526883, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb, great finish for a great photo! The composition ended up working very well. Love this!</td>', 'Deb, great finish for a great photo! The composition ended up working very well. Love this!', '2007-06-11 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767470, 526140, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love the shadows here. I didn''t vote in this challenge, but remember pausing to look closely at this one as I find it very artistic. Excellent job!</td>', 'Love the shadows here. I didn''t vote in this challenge, but remember pausing to look closely at this one as I find it very artistic. Excellent job!', '2007-06-11 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767476, 527261, 66597, '<td valign="top">I thought this was yours when thumbing through the entries (I didn''t vote in this challenge). Extremely creative as always! You come up with ideas that would never occur to me in a million years. Very cool.</td>', 'I thought this was yours when thumbing through the entries (I didn''t vote in this challenge). Extremely creative as always! You come up with ideas that would never occur to me in a million years. Very cool.', '2007-06-11 10:39:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767477, 527075, 68035, '<td valign="top"><i><b>Post Challenge</b></i> <br/> <br/>Oh dear...4.4714% and 4% shows that I got this one seriously wrong perhaps I should have stuck with a more obvious interpretation of the balancing arms <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=533355" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/68035/thumb/533355.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/68035/thumb/533355.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/68035/thumb/533355.jpg"/></a>, but I really liked the image I entered and hoped that other people would see the double take more than perhaps they did</td>', 'Post Challenge  Oh dear...4.4714% and 4% shows that I got this one seriously wrong perhaps I should have stuck with a more obvious interpretation of the balancing arms , but I really liked the image I entered and hoped that other people would see the double take more than perhaps they did', '2007-06-11 10:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767482, 524935, 66597, '<td valign="top">Colleen, this is so cool! Love the color choices and just how very weird it is - yet it totally works for me. This would make an excellent print. Think you might be able to sell it or show in a gallery.</td>', 'Colleen, this is so cool! Love the color choices and just how very weird it is - yet it totally works for me. This would make an excellent print. Think you might be able to sell it or show in a gallery.', '2007-06-11 10:41:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3767489, 527613, 68035, '<td valign="top">Christy<br/> <br/>I had given this an 8 in the challenge but had commented that it might have been better in colour.  Having seen the colour version in your outtakes I can now say that you called it dead right.  B&amp;W was the better version</td>', 'Christy I had given this an 8 in the challenge but had commented that it might have been better in colour.  Having seen the colour version in your outtakes I can now say that you called it dead right.  B&W was the better version', '2007-06-11 10:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
