(3768379, 527472, 51538, '<td valign="top">Why so low?  I simply hate images of cameras.  So introspective really.  But that''s my personal hangup.  I voted this a 3 and stick by it.  Apart from the dislike of cameras as subject matter, I think the overall image requires too much work from the viewer to be interesting.  Well you did ask why? :)</td>', 'Why so low?  I simply hate images of cameras.  So introspective really.  But that''s my personal hangup.  I voted this a 3 and stick by it.  Apart from the dislike of cameras as subject matter, I think the overall image requires too much work from the viewer to be interesting.  Well you did ask why? :)', '2007-06-11 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3768401, 527472, 48546, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pineapple:</b></div><hr/><i> Why so low?  I simply hate images of cameras.  So introspective really.  But that''s my personal hangup.  I voted this a 3 and stick by it.  Apart from the dislike of cameras as subject matter, I think the overall image requires too much work from the viewer to be interesting.  Well you did ask why? :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, I did ask why.<br/> <br/>Thank you for your response.</td>', 'Originally posted by pineapple: Why so low?  I simply hate images of cameras.  So introspective really.  But that''s my personal hangup.  I voted this a 3 and stick by it.  Apart from the dislike of cameras as subject matter, I think the overall image requires too much work from the viewer to be interesting.  Well you did ask why? :)   Yes, I did ask why. Thank you for your response.', '2007-06-11 14:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
