(3768662, 527472, 40484, '<td valign="top">Personally, I didn''t vote on this challenge but would probably have given this image a 5 if I did. The composition and focus are well done but the subject matter is not overly interesting to me. The lighting seems rather flat to me. Perhaps some different lighting that would spotlight the cameras more and add more depth to the shot would make a difference. :)</td>', 'Personally, I didn''t vote on this challenge but would probably have given this image a 5 if I did. The composition and focus are well done but the subject matter is not overly interesting to me. The lighting seems rather flat to me. Perhaps some different lighting that would spotlight the cameras more and add more depth to the shot would make a difference. :)', '2007-06-11 16:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
