(3768860, 526704, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this composition and think it works well in b&amp;w.  I get a little distracted by the writing on the back of his shirt.  It also might have been better taken a few feet back.  Still, a nice shot overall. I was one of your 8''s.</td>', 'I like this composition and think it works well in b&w.  I get a little distracted by the writing on the back of his shirt.  It also might have been better taken a few feet back.  Still, a nice shot overall. I was one of your 8''s.', '2007-06-11 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3768889, 526907, 50695, '<td valign="top">well, there''s the picture and then there''s the challenge. I like the picture alright. The odd green light and the faded backlighting give this a sense of mystery.<br/> <br/>But to try to rope in lake reflections into double take is a scarifying idea. Imagine if other people decided to do this. The challenge would fill up with yawnworthy landscape shots. Yikes.</td>', 'well, there''s the picture and then there''s the challenge. I like the picture alright. The odd green light and the faded backlighting give this a sense of mystery. But to try to rope in lake reflections into double take is a scarifying idea. Imagine if other people decided to do this. The challenge would fill up with yawnworthy landscape shots. Yikes.', '2007-06-11 16:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3768918, 526907, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture - I would struggle to see it as a double take, I think if you wanted that the water would have to be like a mirror and show every detail of the trees in great clarity.<br/> <br/>But still a really nice shot anyway  :  )</td>', 'Really nice picture - I would struggle to see it as a double take, I think if you wanted that the water would have to be like a mirror and show every detail of the trees in great clarity. But still a really nice shot anyway  :  )', '2007-06-11 17:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
