(3769789, 527599, 63360, '<td valign="top">This is really quite striking.  I really like your use of negative space and the brown tones are great.  I like the lighting, but this might have scored higher if there was a bit more light directed onto the cello in the background.  Keep up the great work!</td>', 'This is really quite striking.  I really like your use of negative space and the brown tones are great.  I like the lighting, but this might have scored higher if there was a bit more light directed onto the cello in the background.  Keep up the great work!', '2007-06-11 20:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
