(3772225, 527291, 79242, '<td valign="top">Well, you dropped me a comment on one of my photos and I thought I would return the favor. I like the idea behind this photo, but there are a few things that I think I would change. The pair of boots are a cool idea, but I think I would like to see more of them. The dog also seems like he is a little out of focus. Maybe a little more DOF. Not a bad photo though, and i like the creativity of the idea more than many in the competition..<br/></td>', 'Well, you dropped me a comment on one of my photos and I thought I would return the favor. I like the idea behind this photo, but there are a few things that I think I would change. The pair of boots are a cool idea, but I think I would like to see more of them. The dog also seems like he is a little out of focus. Maybe a little more DOF. Not a bad photo though, and i like the creativity of the idea more than many in the competition..', '2007-06-12 10:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
