(3779182, 526974, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7. Basically, that means I love the capture, I love these women. I didn''t vote it higher because the composition is pretty standard, you just cropped as close to them as possible, and there''s some bright white clutter (bags, blanket(?), cooler) that I find distracting. But the women are so cool. One woman has no head (just a hat) and the other woman is just a floating head with a hint of a torso.</td>', 'I gave this a 7. Basically, that means I love the capture, I love these women. I didn''t vote it higher because the composition is pretty standard, you just cropped as close to them as possible, and there''s some bright white clutter (bags, blanket(?), cooler) that I find distracting. But the women are so cool. One woman has no head (just a hat) and the other woman is just a floating head with a hint of a torso.', '2007-06-13 16:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3779184, 527075, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well, Jon - though my Double Take entry was SO BAD - yours was WORSE! :op<br/> <br/>I win again! lalala....<br/> <br/>But seriously (sic!) I do like this entry and am astonished that it came in so low. I think you''re right in saying that people weren''t SEEING what it was - though when you read the title, it''s pretty obvious. Oh well - onward to the next challenge - hopefully better for both of us. <br/> <br/>Cheers, Alicia</td>', 'Well, Jon - though my Double Take entry was SO BAD - yours was WORSE! :op I win again! lalala.... But seriously (sic!) I do like this entry and am astonished that it came in so low. I think you''re right in saying that people weren''t SEEING what it was - though when you read the title, it''s pretty obvious. Oh well - onward to the next challenge - hopefully better for both of us.  Cheers, Alicia', '2007-06-13 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 0),
