(3782702, 527075, 67697, '<td valign="top">First, always submit what you like.  Then rejoice in those who get it lol.  And alas, I was one who did not.  I musta been a speed voter that day.  I was one of your 5''s.  I remembered thinking that I loved how the item in the foreground was sharp and really caught your attention.  Then of course I did not see the one in the background lol.  I''m usually unobservant about these things anyway.  :)  If your intended focus was to be the two locks, I am wondering how a different perspective might have looked?  (Maybe so that the front lock is actually lower in the pic.)  Also on my screen, the black of the second lock just got lost in the background.  Anyway, keep submitting pics you like - what fun would it be if you didn''t?  :D</td>', 'First, always submit what you like.  Then rejoice in those who get it lol.  And alas, I was one who did not.  I musta been a speed voter that day.  I was one of your 5''s.  I remembered thinking that I loved how the item in the foreground was sharp and really caught your attention.  Then of course I did not see the one in the background lol.  I''m usually unobservant about these things anyway.  :)  If your intended focus was to be the two locks, I am wondering how a different perspective might have looked?  (Maybe so that the front lock is actually lower in the pic.)  Also on my screen, the black of the second lock just got lost in the background.  Anyway, keep submitting pics you like - what fun would it be if you didn''t?  :D', '2007-06-14 10:02:52.000000', NULL, 0),
