(3787243, 526864, 47541, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>Fit: The image fits the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Composition: Generally I''ve never minded photos that center the subject too much but I think that is the main problem in this image.  Not only are the people right in the middle of the image but the "horizon" (the bottom of the fence) is a bit close to the middle.<br/> <br/>Technical: The lighting is a bit "middle of the day".  Slightly less exposure would have helped a bit.<br/> <br/>Feel: The idea of the shot is great.  It has an emotional link with the viewer and hopefully it is something that we can all relate to in some way.  Without the technical issues mentioned above and byt the commenters this would have done a lot better.<br/> <br/>PM me if you have any queries</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club. Fit: The image fits the challenge well. Composition: Generally I''ve never minded photos that center the subject too much but I think that is the main problem in this image.  Not only are the people right in the middle of the image but the "horizon" (the bottom of the fence) is a bit close to the middle. Technical: The lighting is a bit "middle of the day".  Slightly less exposure would have helped a bit. Feel: The idea of the shot is great.  It has an emotional link with the viewer and hopefully it is something that we can all relate to in some way.  Without the technical issues mentioned above and byt the commenters this would have done a lot better. PM me if you have any queries', '2007-06-15 05:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3787319, 527678, 28710, '<td valign="top">very pleasing to the eye. It takes a few seconds to count the rocks to account for where everything is... that rock poking out of the water really throws things for me.<br/> <br/>if only the water was just a tiny bit more still, this woul really take off. good stuff!</td>', 'very pleasing to the eye. It takes a few seconds to count the rocks to account for where everything is... that rock poking out of the water really throws things for me. if only the water was just a tiny bit more still, this woul really take off. good stuff!', '2007-06-15 06:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
